('916fdaee-856b-5a0a-bf94-5f3859c1c581'::uuid, 2, 6, 53, 53, 'न चैतद्विद्मः कतरन्नो गरीयो

यद्वा जयेम यदि वा नो जयेयुः।

यानेव हत्वा न जिजीविषाम

स्तेऽवस्थिताः प्रमुखे धार्तराष्ट्राः।।2.6।।', 'na chaitadvidmaḥ kataranno garīyo
yadvā jayema yadi vā no jayeyuḥ
yāneva hatvā na jijīviṣhāmas
te ’vasthitāḥ pramukhe dhārtarāṣhṭrāḥ', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"etat","meaning":"this"},{"word":"vidmaḥ","meaning":"we know"},{"word":"katarat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"naḥ","meaning":"for us"},{"word":"garīyaḥ","meaning":"is preferable"},{"word":"yat vā","meaning":"whether"},{"word":"jayema","meaning":"we may conquer"},{"word":"yadi","meaning":"if"},{"word":"vā","meaning":"or"},{"word":"naḥ","meaning":"us"},{"word":"jayeyuḥ","meaning":"they may conquer"},{"word":"yān","meaning":"whom"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"hatvā","meaning":"after killing"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"jijīviṣhāmaḥ","meaning":"we desire to live"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"avasthitāḥ","meaning":"are standing"},{"word":"pramukhe","meaning":"before us"},{"word":"dhārtarāṣhṭrāḥ","meaning":"the sons of Dhritarashtra"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; cha—and; etat—this; vidmaḥ—we know; katarat—which; naḥ—for us; garīyaḥ—is preferable; yat vā—whether; jayema—we may conquer; yadi—if; vā—or; naḥ—us; jayeyuḥ—they may conquer; yān—whom; eva—certainly; hatvā—after killing; na—not; jijīviṣhāmaḥ—we desire to live; te—they; avasthitāḥ—are standing; pramukhe—before us; dhārtarāṣhṭrāḥ—the sons of Dhritarashtra'),
('81ce4613-6e7c-55b1-a344-8187e2487d59'::uuid, 2, 7, 54, 54, 'कार्पण्यदोषोपहतस्वभावः

पृच्छामि त्वां धर्मसंमूढचेताः।

यच्छ्रेयः स्यान्निश्िचतं ब्रूहि तन्मे

शिष्यस्तेऽहं शाधि मां त्वां प्रपन्नम्।।2.7।।', 'kārpaṇya-doṣhopahata-svabhāvaḥ
pṛichchhāmi tvāṁ dharma-sammūḍha-chetāḥ
yach-chhreyaḥ syānniśhchitaṁ brūhi tanme
