na chaiva na bhaviṣhyāmaḥ sarve vayamataḥ param', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"however"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"jātu","meaning":"at any time"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"āsam","meaning":"exist"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"ime","meaning":"these"},{"word":"jana","meaning":"adhipāḥ—kings"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"na bhaviṣhyāmaḥ","meaning":"shall not exist"},{"word":"sarve vayam","meaning":"all of us"},{"word":"ataḥ","meaning":"from now"},{"word":"param","meaning":"after"}]'::jsonb, 'na—never; tu—however; eva—certainly; aham—I; jātu—at any time; na—nor; āsam—exist; na—nor; tvam—you; na—nor; ime—these; jana-adhipāḥ—kings; na—never; cha—also; eva—indeed; na bhaviṣhyāmaḥ—shall not exist; sarve vayam—all of us; ataḥ—from now; param—after'),
('ab6be0cb-4af4-5f9a-83da-c51c03f3f724'::uuid, 2, 13, 60, 60, 'देहिनोऽस्मिन्यथा देहे कौमारं यौवनं जरा।

तथा देहान्तरप्राप्तिर्धीरस्तत्र न मुह्यति।।2.13।।', 'dehino ’smin yathā dehe kaumāraṁ yauvanaṁ jarā
