('0fdee932-dce7-51d5-8585-e8abe7edcf99'::uuid, 3, 3, 122, 122, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

लोकेऽस्मिन्द्विविधा निष्ठा पुरा प्रोक्ता मयानघ।

ज्ञानयोगेन सांख्यानां कर्मयोगेन योगिनाम्।।3.3।।', 'śhrī bhagavān uvācha
loke’smin dvi-vidhā niṣhṭhā purā proktā mayānagha
jñāna-yogena sāṅkhyānāṁ karma-yogena yoginām', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said"},{"word":"loke","meaning":"in the world"},{"word":"asmin","meaning":"this"},{"word":"dvi","meaning":"vidhā—two kinds of"},{"word":"niṣhṭhā","meaning":"faith"},{"word":"purā","meaning":"previously"},{"word":"proktā","meaning":"explained"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me (Shree Krishna)"},{"word":"anagha","meaning":"sinless"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"yogena—through the path of knowledge"},{"word":"sānkhyānām","meaning":"for those inclined toward contemplation"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"yogena—through the path of action"},{"word":"yoginām","meaning":"of the yogis"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said; loke—in the world; asmin—this; dvi-vidhā—two kinds of; niṣhṭhā—faith; purā—previously; proktā—explained; mayā—by me (Shree Krishna); anagha—sinless; jñāna-yogena—through the path of knowledge; sānkhyānām—for those inclined toward contemplation; karma-yogena—through the path of action; yoginām—of the yogis'),
('dc57ccd7-d9b7-537b-8c0c-5238994d6325'::uuid, 3, 4, 123, 123, 'न कर्मणामनारम्भान्नैष्कर्म्यं पुरुषोऽश्नुते।

न च संन्यसनादेव सिद्धिं समधिगच्छति।।3.4।।', 'na karmaṇām anārambhān naiṣhkarmyaṁ puruṣho ’śhnute
na cha sannyasanād eva siddhiṁ samadhigachchhati', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"karmaṇām","meaning":"of actions"},{"word":"anārambhāt","meaning":"by abstaining from"},{"word":"naiṣhkarmyam","meaning":"freedom from karmic reactions"},{"word":"puruṣhaḥ","meaning":"a person"},{"word":"aśhnute","meaning":"attains"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"sannyasanāt","meaning":"by renunciation"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"only"},{"word":"siddhim","meaning":"perfection"},{"word":"samadhigachchhati","meaning":"attains"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; karmaṇām—of actions; anārambhāt—by abstaining from; naiṣhkarmyam—freedom from karmic reactions; puruṣhaḥ—a person; aśhnute—attains; na—not; cha—and; sannyasanāt—by renunciation; eva—only; siddhim—perfection; samadhigachchhati—attains'),
('694b87d1-7dc9-55c3-8020-a358e1d8e014'::uuid, 3, 5, 124, 124, 'न हि कश्िचत्क्षणमपि जातु तिष्ठत्यकर्मकृत्।

कार्यते ह्यवशः कर्म सर्वः प्रकृतिजैर्गुणैः।।3.5।।', 'na hi kaśhchit kṣhaṇam api jātu tiṣhṭhatyakarma-kṛit
kāryate hyavaśhaḥ karma sarvaḥ prakṛiti-jair guṇaiḥ', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"kaśhchit","meaning":"anyone"},{"word":"kṣhaṇam","meaning":"a moment"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"jātu","meaning":"ever"},{"word":"tiṣhṭhati","meaning":"can remain"},{"word":"akarma","meaning":"kṛit—without action"},{"word":"kāryate","meaning":"are performed"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"avaśhaḥ","meaning":"helpless"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"work"},{"word":"sarvaḥ","meaning":"all"},{"word":"prakṛiti","meaning":"jaiḥ—born of material nature"},{"word":"guṇaiḥ","meaning":"by the qualities"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; hi—certainly; kaśhchit—anyone; kṣhaṇam—a moment; api—even; jātu—ever; tiṣhṭhati—can remain; akarma-kṛit—without action; kāryate—are performed; hi—certainly; avaśhaḥ—helpless; karma—work; sarvaḥ—all; prakṛiti-jaiḥ—born of material nature; guṇaiḥ—by the qualities'),
('c75a64bd-71b5-5e3f-892b-0ced0b633dd2'::uuid, 3, 6, 125, 125, 'कर्मेन्द्रियाणि संयम्य य आस्ते मनसा स्मरन्।

इन्द्रियार्थान्विमूढात्मा मिथ्याचारः स उच्यते।।3.6।।', 'karmendriyāṇi sanyamya ya āste manasā smaran
indriyārthān vimūḍhātmā mithyāchāraḥ sa uchyate', '[{"word":"karma","meaning":"indriyāṇi—the organs of action"},{"word":"sanyamya","meaning":"restrain"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"āste","meaning":"remain"},{"word":"manasā","meaning":"in the mind"},{"word":"smaran","meaning":"to remember"},{"word":"indriya","meaning":"arthān—sense objects"},{"word":"vimūḍha","meaning":"ātmā—the deluded"},{"word":"mithyā","meaning":"āchāraḥ—hypocrite"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"uchyate","meaning":"are called"}]'::jsonb, 'karma-indriyāṇi—the organs of action; sanyamya—restrain; yaḥ—who; āste—remain; manasā—in the mind; smaran—to remember; indriya-arthān—sense objects; vimūḍha-ātmā—the deluded; mithyā-āchāraḥ—hypocrite; saḥ—they; uchyate—are called'),
('bb8ff35c-911b-5e58-ab5b-780a9cd158a3'::uuid, 3, 7, 126, 126, 'यस्त्विन्द्रियाणि मनसा नियम्यारभतेऽर्जुन।

कर्मेन्द्रियैः कर्मयोगमसक्तः स विशिष्यते।।3.7।।', 'yas tvindriyāṇi manasā niyamyārabhate ’rjuna
karmendriyaiḥ karma-yogam asaktaḥ sa viśhiṣhyate', '[{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"indriyāṇi","meaning":"the senses"},{"word":"manasā","meaning":"by the mind"},{"word":"niyamya","meaning":"control"},{"word":"ārabhate","meaning":"begins"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"indriyaiḥ—by the working senses"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"yogam—karm yog"},{"word":"asaktaḥ","meaning":"without attachment"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"viśhiṣhyate","meaning":"are superior"}]'::jsonb, 'yaḥ—who; tu—but; indriyāṇi—the senses; manasā—by the mind; niyamya—control; ārabhate—begins; arjuna—Arjun; karma-indriyaiḥ—by the working senses; karma-yogam—karm yog; asaktaḥ—without attachment; saḥ—they; viśhiṣhyate—are superior'),
('da0afc0f-2bc2-5875-accb-5f40204e5bc7'::uuid, 3, 8, 127, 127, 'नियतं कुरु कर्म त्वं कर्म ज्यायो ह्यकर्मणः।

शरीरयात्रापि च ते न प्रसिद्ध्येदकर्मणः।।3.8।।', 'niyataṁ kuru karma tvaṁ karma jyāyo hyakarmaṇaḥ
śharīra-yātrāpi cha te na prasiddhyed akarmaṇaḥ', '[{"word":"niyatam","meaning":"constantly"},{"word":"kuru","meaning":"perform"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"Vedic duties"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"jyāyaḥ","meaning":"superior"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"akarmaṇaḥ","meaning":"than inaction"},{"word":"śharīra","meaning":"bodily"},{"word":"yātrā","meaning":"maintenance"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"te","meaning":"your"},{"word":"na prasiddhyet","meaning":"would not be possible"},{"word":"akarmaṇaḥ","meaning":"inaction"}]'::jsonb, 'niyatam—constantly; kuru—perform; karma—Vedic duties; tvam—you; karma—action; jyāyaḥ—superior; hi—certainly; akarmaṇaḥ—than inaction; śharīra—bodily; yātrā—maintenance; api—even; cha—and; te—your; na prasiddhyet—would not be possible; akarmaṇaḥ—inaction'),
('51171b67-ae21-551a-b660-a9234c980200'::uuid, 3, 9, 128, 128, 'यज्ञार्थात्कर्मणोऽन्यत्र लोकोऽयं कर्मबन्धनः।

तदर्थं कर्म कौन्तेय मुक्तसंगः समाचर।।3.9।।', 'yajñārthāt karmaṇo ’nyatra loko ’yaṁ karma-bandhanaḥ
tad-arthaṁ karma kaunteya mukta-saṅgaḥ samāchara', '[{"word":"yajña","meaning":"arthāt—for the sake of sacrifice"},{"word":"karmaṇaḥ","meaning":"than action"},{"word":"anyatra","meaning":"else"},{"word":"lokaḥ","meaning":"material world"},{"word":"ayam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"bandhanaḥ—bondage through one’s work"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"artham","meaning":"for the sake of"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"kaunteya","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Kunti"},{"word":"mukta","meaning":"saṅgaḥ—free from attachment"},{"word":"samāchara","meaning":"perform properly"}]'::jsonb, 'yajña-arthāt—for the sake of sacrifice; karmaṇaḥ—than action; anyatra—else; lokaḥ—material world; ayam—this; karma-bandhanaḥ—bondage through one’s work; tat—that; artham—for the sake of; karma—action; kaunteya—Arjun, the son of Kunti; mukta-saṅgaḥ—free from attachment; samāchara—perform properly'),
('b4d64f6f-10e9-594b-980c-c1fc6091425c'::uuid, 3, 10, 129, 129, 'सहयज्ञाः प्रजाः सृष्ट्वा पुरोवाच प्रजापतिः।

अनेन प्रसविष्यध्वमेष वोऽस्त्विष्टकामधुक्।।3.10।।', 'saha-yajñāḥ prajāḥ sṛiṣhṭvā purovācha prajāpatiḥ
anena prasaviṣhyadhvam eṣha vo ’stviṣhṭa-kāma-dhuk', '[{"word":"saha","meaning":"along with"},{"word":"yajñāḥ","meaning":"sacrifices"},{"word":"prajāḥ","meaning":"humankind"},{"word":"sṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"created"},{"word":"purā","meaning":"in beginning"},{"word":"uvācha","meaning":"said"},{"word":"prajā","meaning":"patiḥ—Brahma"},{"word":"anena","meaning":"by this"},{"word":"prasaviṣhyadhvam","meaning":"increase prosperity"},{"word":"eṣhaḥ","meaning":"these"},{"word":"vaḥ","meaning":"your"},{"word":"astu","meaning":"shall be"},{"word":"iṣhṭa","meaning":"kāma-dhuk—bestower of all wishes"}]'::jsonb, 'saha—along with; yajñāḥ—sacrifices; prajāḥ—humankind; sṛiṣhṭvā—created; purā—in beginning; uvācha—said; prajā-patiḥ—Brahma; anena—by this; prasaviṣhyadhvam—increase prosperity; eṣhaḥ—these; vaḥ—your; astu—shall be; iṣhṭa-kāma-dhuk—bestower of all wishes'),
('6535e4a9-946a-5236-8f88-6f5663fa44b3'::uuid, 3, 11, 130, 130, 'देवान्भावयतानेन ते देवा भावयन्तु वः।

परस्परं भावयन्तः श्रेयः परमवाप्स्यथ।।3.11।।', 'devān bhāvayatānena te devā bhāvayantu vaḥ
parasparaṁ bhāvayantaḥ śhreyaḥ param avāpsyatha', '[{"word":"devān","meaning":"celestial gods"},{"word":"bhāvayatā","meaning":"will be pleased"},{"word":"anena","meaning":"by these (sacrifices)"},{"word":"te","meaning":"those"},{"word":"devāḥ","meaning":"celestial gods"},{"word":"bhāvayantu","meaning":"will be pleased"},{"word":"vaḥ","meaning":"you"},{"word":"parasparam","meaning":"one another"},{"word":"bhāvayantaḥ","meaning":"pleasing one another"},{"word":"śhreyaḥ","meaning":"prosperity"},{"word":"param","meaning":"the supreme"},{"word":"avāpsyatha","meaning":"shall achieve"}]'::jsonb, 'devān—celestial gods; bhāvayatā—will be pleased; anena—by these (sacrifices); te—those; devāḥ—celestial gods; bhāvayantu—will be pleased; vaḥ—you; parasparam—one another; bhāvayantaḥ—pleasing one another; śhreyaḥ—prosperity; param—the supreme; avāpsyatha—shall achieve'),
('d8648255-5bda-5733-876c-74994b2ec9cc'::uuid, 3, 12, 131, 131, 'इष्टान्भोगान्हि वो देवा दास्यन्ते यज्ञभाविताः।

तैर्दत्तानप्रदायैभ्यो यो भुङ्क्ते स्तेन एव सः।।3.12।।', 'iṣhṭān bhogān hi vo devā dāsyante yajña-bhāvitāḥ
tair dattān apradāyaibhyo yo bhuṅkte stena eva saḥ', '[{"word":"iṣhṭān","meaning":"desired"},{"word":"bhogān","meaning":"necessities of life"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"vaḥ","meaning":"unto you"},{"word":"devāḥ","meaning":"the celestial gods"},{"word":"dāsyante","meaning":"will grant"},{"word":"yajña","meaning":"bhāvitāḥ—satisfied by sacrifice"},{"word":"taiḥ","meaning":"by them"},{"word":"dattān","meaning":"things granted"},{"word":"apradāya","meaning":"without offering"},{"word":"ebhyaḥ","meaning":"to them"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"bhuṅkte","meaning":"enjoys"},{"word":"stenaḥ","meaning":"thieves"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"verily"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"}]'::jsonb, 'iṣhṭān—desired; bhogān—necessities of life; hi—certainly; vaḥ—unto you; devāḥ—the celestial gods; dāsyante—will grant; yajña-bhāvitāḥ—satisfied by sacrifice; taiḥ—by them; dattān—things granted; apradāya—without offering; ebhyaḥ—to them; yaḥ—who; bhuṅkte—enjoys; stenaḥ—thieves; eva—verily; saḥ—they'),
('30dcdf09-d955-5bc0-a1ec-00e65b42aac3'::uuid, 3, 13, 132, 132, 'यज्ञशिष्टाशिनः सन्तो मुच्यन्ते सर्वकिल्बिषैः।

भुञ्जते ते त्वघं पापा ये पचन्त्यात्मकारणात्।।3.13।।', 'yajña-śhiṣhṭāśhinaḥ santo muchyante sarva-kilbiṣhaiḥ
bhuñjate te tvaghaṁ pāpā ye pachantyātma-kāraṇāt', '[{"word":"yajña","meaning":"śhiṣhṭa—of remnants of food offered in sacrifice"},{"word":"aśhinaḥ","meaning":"eaters"},{"word":"santaḥ","meaning":"saintly persons"},{"word":"muchyante","meaning":"are released"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"all kinds of"},{"word":"kilbiṣhaiḥ","meaning":"from sins"},{"word":"bhuñjate","meaning":"enjoy"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"agham","meaning":"sins"},{"word":"pāpāḥ","meaning":"sinners"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"pachanti","meaning":"cook (food)"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"kāraṇāt—for their own sake"}]'::jsonb, 'yajña-śhiṣhṭa—of remnants of food offered in sacrifice; aśhinaḥ—eaters; santaḥ—saintly persons; muchyante—are released; sarva—all kinds of; kilbiṣhaiḥ—from sins; bhuñjate—enjoy; te—they; tu—but; agham—sins; pāpāḥ—sinners; ye—who; pachanti—cook (food); ātma-kāraṇāt—for their own sake'),
('e70eda3d-179a-5302-8cc8-faf33f91be49'::uuid, 3, 14, 133, 133, 'अन्नाद्भवन्ति भूतानि पर्जन्यादन्नसम्भवः।

यज्ञाद्भवति पर्जन्यो यज्ञः कर्मसमुद्भवः।।3.14।।', 'annād bhavanti bhūtāni parjanyād anna-sambhavaḥ
yajñād bhavati parjanyo yajñaḥ karma-samudbhavaḥ', '[{"word":"annāt","meaning":"from food"},{"word":"bhavanti","meaning":"subsist"},{"word":"bhūtāni","meaning":"living beings"},{"word":"parjanyāt","meaning":"from rains"},{"word":"anna","meaning":"of food grains"},{"word":"sambhavaḥ","meaning":"production"},{"word":"yajñāt","meaning":"from the performance of sacrifice"},{"word":"bhavati","meaning":"becomes possible"},{"word":"parjanyaḥ","meaning":"rain"},{"word":"yajñaḥ","meaning":"performance of sacrifice"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"prescribed duties"},{"word":"samudbhavaḥ","meaning":"born of"}]'::jsonb, 'annāt—from food; bhavanti—subsist; bhūtāni—living beings; parjanyāt—from rains; anna—of food grains; sambhavaḥ—production; yajñāt—from the performance of sacrifice; bhavati—becomes possible; parjanyaḥ—rain; yajñaḥ—performance of sacrifice; karma—prescribed duties; samudbhavaḥ—born of'),
('5c3ddb00-90a4-5c8c-ac9b-978fecca99e1'::uuid, 3, 15, 134, 134, 'कर्म ब्रह्मोद्भवं विद्धि ब्रह्माक्षरसमुद्भवम्।

तस्मात्सर्वगतं ब्रह्म नित्यं यज्ञे प्रतिष्ठितम्।।3.15।।', 'karma brahmodbhavaṁ viddhi brahmākṣhara-samudbhavam
tasmāt sarva-gataṁ brahma nityaṁ yajñe pratiṣhṭhitam', '[{"word":"karma","meaning":"duties"},{"word":"brahma","meaning":"in the Vedas"},{"word":"udbhavam","meaning":"manifested"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"you should know"},{"word":"brahma","meaning":"The Vedas"},{"word":"akṣhara","meaning":"from the Imperishable (God)"},{"word":"samudbhavam","meaning":"directly manifested"},{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"gatam—all-pervading"},{"word":"brahma","meaning":"The Lord"},{"word":"nityam","meaning":"eternally"},{"word":"yajñe","meaning":"in sacrifice"},{"word":"pratiṣhṭhitam","meaning":"established"}]'::jsonb, 'karma—duties; brahma—in the Vedas; udbhavam—manifested; viddhi—you should know; brahma—The Vedas; akṣhara—from the Imperishable (God); samudbhavam—directly manifested; tasmāt—therefore; sarva-gatam—all-pervading; brahma—The Lord; nityam—eternally; yajñe—in sacrifice; pratiṣhṭhitam—established'),
('6943c13a-442c-5fda-9280-1efde3c2789f'::uuid, 3, 16, 135, 135, 'एवं प्रवर्तितं चक्रं नानुवर्तयतीह यः।

अघायुरिन्द्रियारामो मोघं पार्थ स जीवति।।3.16।।', 'evaṁ pravartitaṁ chakraṁ nānuvartayatīha yaḥ
aghāyur indriyārāmo moghaṁ pārtha sa jīvati', '[{"word":"evam","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"pravartitam","meaning":"set into motion"},{"word":"chakram","meaning":"cycle"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"anuvartayati","meaning":"follow"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"in this life"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"agha","meaning":"āyuḥ—sinful living"},{"word":"indriya","meaning":"ārāmaḥ—for the delight of their senses"},{"word":"mogham","meaning":"vainly"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"jīvati","meaning":"live"}]'::jsonb, 'evam—thus; pravartitam—set into motion; chakram—cycle; na—not; anuvartayati—follow; iha—in this life; yaḥ—who; agha-āyuḥ—sinful living; indriya-ārāmaḥ—for the delight of their senses; mogham—vainly; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; saḥ—they; jīvati—live'),
('bccb8135-facd-5266-8567-729951c1bfe8'::uuid, 3, 17, 136, 136, 'यस्त्वात्मरतिरेव स्यादात्मतृप्तश्च मानवः।

आत्मन्येव च सन्तुष्टस्तस्य कार्यं न विद्यते।।3.17।।', 'yas tvātma-ratir eva syād ātma-tṛiptaśh cha mānavaḥ
ātmanyeva cha santuṣhṭas tasya kāryaṁ na vidyate', '[{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"ratiḥ—rejoice in the self"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"syāt","meaning":"is"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"tṛiptaḥ—self-satisfied"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"mānavaḥ","meaning":"human being"},{"word":"ātmani","meaning":"in the self"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"santuṣhṭaḥ","meaning":"satisfied"},{"word":"tasya","meaning":"his"},{"word":"kāryam","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"vidyate","meaning":"exist"}]'::jsonb, 'yaḥ—who; tu—but; ātma-ratiḥ—rejoice in the self; eva—certainly; syāt—is; ātma-tṛiptaḥ—self-satisfied; cha—and; mānavaḥ—human being; ātmani—in the self; eva—certainly; cha—and; santuṣhṭaḥ—satisfied; tasya—his; kāryam—duty; na—not; vidyate—exist'),
('51c4f40f-993e-5226-a4d2-d3beba3277e7'::uuid, 3, 18, 137, 137, 'नैव तस्य कृतेनार्थो नाकृतेनेह कश्चन।

न चास्य सर्वभूतेषु कश्िचदर्थव्यपाश्रयः।।3.18।।', 'naiva tasya kṛitenārtho nākṛiteneha kaśhchana
na chāsya sarva-bhūteṣhu kaśhchid artha-vyapāśhrayaḥ', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"tasya","meaning":"his"},{"word":"kṛitena","meaning":"by discharge of duty"},{"word":"arthaḥ","meaning":"gain"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"akṛitena","meaning":"without discharge of duty"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"here"},{"word":"kaśhchana","meaning":"whatsoever"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"asya","meaning":"of that person"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūteṣhu—among all living beings"},{"word":"kaśhchit","meaning":"any"},{"word":"artha","meaning":"necessity"},{"word":"vyapāśhrayaḥ","meaning":"to depend upon"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; eva—indeed; tasya—his; kṛitena—by discharge of duty; arthaḥ—gain; na—not; akṛitena—without discharge of duty; iha—here; kaśhchana—whatsoever; na—never; cha—and; asya—of that person; sarva-bhūteṣhu—among all living beings; kaśhchit—any; artha—necessity; vyapāśhrayaḥ—to depend upon'),
('06fd4067-6275-53e0-b76b-d63746b83f6c'::uuid, 3, 19, 138, 138, 'तस्मादसक्तः सततं कार्यं कर्म समाचर।

असक्तो ह्याचरन्कर्म परमाप्नोति पूरुषः।।3.19।।', 'tasmād asaktaḥ satataṁ kāryaṁ karma samāchara
asakto hyācharan karma param āpnoti pūruṣhaḥ', '[{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"asaktaḥ","meaning":"without attachment"},{"word":"satatam","meaning":"constantly"},{"word":"kāryam","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"samāchara","meaning":"perform"},{"word":"asaktaḥ","meaning":"unattached"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"ācharan","meaning":"performing"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"work"},{"word":"param","meaning":"the Supreme"},{"word":"āpnoti","meaning":"attains"},{"word":"pūruṣhaḥ","meaning":"a person"}]'::jsonb, 'tasmāt—therefore; asaktaḥ—without attachment; satatam—constantly; kāryam—duty; karma—action; samāchara—perform; asaktaḥ—unattached; hi—certainly; ācharan—performing; karma—work; param—the Supreme; āpnoti—attains; pūruṣhaḥ—a person'),
('d2b07086-689c-5cab-9436-6428fc4eb543'::uuid, 3, 20, 139, 139, 'कर्मणैव हि संसिद्धिमास्थिता जनकादयः।

लोकसंग्रहमेवापि संपश्यन्कर्तुमर्हसि।।3.20।।', 'karmaṇaiva hi sansiddhim āsthitā janakādayaḥ
loka-saṅgraham evāpi sampaśhyan kartum arhasi', '[{"word":"karmaṇā","meaning":"by the performance of prescribed duties"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"only"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"sansiddhim","meaning":"perfection"},{"word":"āsthitāḥ","meaning":"attained"},{"word":"janaka","meaning":"ādayaḥ—King Janak and other kings"},{"word":"loka","meaning":"saṅgraham—for the welfare of the masses"},{"word":"eva api","meaning":"only"},{"word":"sampaśhyan","meaning":"considering"},{"word":"kartum","meaning":"to perform"},{"word":"arhasi","meaning":"you should"}]'::jsonb, 'karmaṇā—by the performance of prescribed duties; eva—only; hi—certainly; sansiddhim—perfection; āsthitāḥ—attained; janaka-ādayaḥ—King Janak and other kings; loka-saṅgraham—for the welfare of the masses; eva api—only; sampaśhyan—considering; kartum—to perform; arhasi—you should;'),
('487bbb4e-9745-5da9-a56f-30bdf521760a'::uuid, 3, 21, 140, 140, 'यद्यदाचरति श्रेष्ठस्तत्तदेवेतरो जनः।

स यत्प्रमाणं कुरुते लोकस्तदनुवर्तते।।3.21।।', 'yad yad ācharati śhreṣhṭhas tat tad evetaro janaḥ
sa yat pramāṇaṁ kurute lokas tad anuvartate', '[{"word":"yat yat","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"ācharati","meaning":"does"},{"word":"śhreṣhṭhaḥ","meaning":"the best"},{"word":"tat tat","meaning":"that (alone)"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"itaraḥ","meaning":"common"},{"word":"janaḥ","meaning":"people"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"whichever"},{"word":"pramāṇam","meaning":"standard"},{"word":"kurute","meaning":"perform"},{"word":"lokaḥ","meaning":"world"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"anuvartate","meaning":"pursues"}]'::jsonb, 'yat yat—whatever; ācharati—does; śhreṣhṭhaḥ—the best; tat tat—that (alone); eva—certainly; itaraḥ—common; janaḥ—people; saḥ—they; yat—whichever; pramāṇam—standard; kurute—perform; lokaḥ—world; tat—that; anuvartate—pursues'),
('f8b9d024-8589-59d1-b5d5-b61c65cbb222'::uuid, 3, 22, 141, 141, 'न मे पार्थास्ति कर्तव्यं त्रिषु लोकेषु किञ्चन।

नानवाप्तमवाप्तव्यं वर्त एव च कर्मणि।।3.22।।', 'na me pārthāsti kartavyaṁ triṣhu lokeṣhu kiñchana
nānavāptam avāptavyaṁ varta eva cha karmaṇi', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"me","meaning":"mine"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"asti","meaning":"is"},{"word":"kartavyam","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"triṣhu","meaning":"in the three"},{"word":"lokeṣhu","meaning":"worlds"},{"word":"kiñchana","meaning":"any"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"anavāptam","meaning":"to be attained"},{"word":"avāptavyam","meaning":"to be gained"},{"word":"varte","meaning":"I am engaged"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"yet"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"karmaṇi","meaning":"in prescribed duties"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; me—mine; pārtha—Arjun; asti—is; kartavyam—duty; triṣhu—in the three; lokeṣhu—worlds; kiñchana—any; na—not; anavāptam—to be attained; avāptavyam—to be gained; varte—I am engaged; eva—yet; cha—also; karmaṇi—in prescribed duties'),
('2f047970-ab62-50fb-8ec3-f956feea766b'::uuid, 3, 23, 142, 142, 'यदि ह्यहं न वर्तेयं जातु कर्मण्यतन्द्रितः।

मम वर्त्मानुवर्तन्ते मनुष्याः पार्थ सर्वशः।।3.23।।', 'yadi hyahaṁ na varteyaṁ jātu karmaṇyatandritaḥ
mama vartmānuvartante manuṣhyāḥ pārtha sarvaśhaḥ', '[{"word":"yadi","meaning":"if"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"varteyam","meaning":"thus engage"},{"word":"jātu","meaning":"ever"},{"word":"karmaṇi","meaning":"in the performance of prescribed duties"},{"word":"atandritaḥ","meaning":"carefully"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"vartma","meaning":"path"},{"word":"anuvartante","meaning":"follow"},{"word":"manuṣhyāḥ","meaning":"all men"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"sarvaśhaḥ","meaning":"in all respects"}]'::jsonb, 'yadi—if; hi—certainly; aham—I; na—not; varteyam—thus engage; jātu—ever; karmaṇi—in the performance of prescribed duties; atandritaḥ—carefully; mama—my; vartma—path; anuvartante—follow; manuṣhyāḥ—all men; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; sarvaśhaḥ—in all respects'),
('ce3f62ec-89d5-553f-9050-6e695bbec4c2'::uuid, 3, 24, 143, 143, 'उत्सीदेयुरिमे लोका न कुर्यां कर्म चेदहम्।

सङ्करस्य च कर्ता स्यामुपहन्यामिमाः प्रजाः।।3.24।।', 'utsīdeyur ime lokā na kuryāṁ karma ched aham
sankarasya cha kartā syām upahanyām imāḥ prajāḥ', '[{"word":"utsīdeyuḥ","meaning":"would perish"},{"word":"ime","meaning":"all these"},{"word":"lokāḥ","meaning":"worlds"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"kuryām","meaning":"I perform"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"prescribed duties"},{"word":"chet","meaning":"if"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"sankarasya","meaning":"of uncultured population"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"kartā","meaning":"responsible"},{"word":"syām","meaning":"would be"},{"word":"upahanyām","meaning":"would destroy"},{"word":"imāḥ","meaning":"all these"},{"word":"prajāḥ","meaning":"living entities"}]'::jsonb, 'utsīdeyuḥ—would perish; ime—all these; lokāḥ—worlds; na—not; kuryām—I perform; karma—prescribed duties; chet—if; aham—I; sankarasya—of uncultured population; cha—and; kartā—responsible; syām—would be; upahanyām—would destroy; imāḥ—all these; prajāḥ—living entities'),
('1e24e90b-ece3-5e16-aeed-f6d687699003'::uuid, 3, 25, 144, 144, 'सक्ताः कर्मण्यविद्वांसो यथा कुर्वन्ति भारत।

कुर्याद्विद्वांस्तथासक्तश्िचकीर्षुर्लोकसंग्रहम्।।3.25।।', 'saktāḥ karmaṇyavidvānso yathā kurvanti bhārata
kuryād vidvāns tathāsaktaśh chikīrṣhur loka-saṅgraham', '[{"word":"saktāḥ","meaning":"attached"},{"word":"karmaṇi","meaning":"duties"},{"word":"avidvānsaḥ","meaning":"the ignorant"},{"word":"yathā","meaning":"as much as"},{"word":"kurvanti","meaning":"act"},{"word":"bhārata","meaning":"scion of Bharat (Arjun)"},{"word":"kuryāt","meaning":"should do"},{"word":"vidvān","meaning":"the wise"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"asaktaḥ","meaning":"unattached"},{"word":"chikīrṣhuḥ","meaning":"wishing"},{"word":"loka","meaning":"saṅgraham—welfare of the world"}]'::jsonb, 'saktāḥ—attached; karmaṇi—duties; avidvānsaḥ—the ignorant; yathā—as much as; kurvanti—act; bhārata—scion of Bharat (Arjun); kuryāt—should do; vidvān—the wise; tathā—thus; asaktaḥ—unattached; chikīrṣhuḥ—wishing; loka-saṅgraham—welfare of the world'),
('9d743f97-ca3b-56f5-9dd5-71b39a53b737'::uuid, 3, 26, 145, 145, 'न बुद्धिभेदं जनयेदज्ञानां कर्मसङ्गिनाम्।

जोषयेत्सर्वकर्माणि विद्वान् युक्तः समाचरन्।।3.26।।', 'na buddhi-bhedaṁ janayed ajñānāṁ karma-saṅginām
joṣhayet sarva-karmāṇi vidvān yuktaḥ samācharan', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"buddhi","meaning":"bhedam—discord in the intellects"},{"word":"janayet","meaning":"should create"},{"word":"ajñānām","meaning":"of the ignorant"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"saṅginām—who are attached to fruitive actions"},{"word":"joṣhayet","meaning":"should inspire (them) to perform"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"all"},{"word":"karmāṇi","meaning":"prescribed"},{"word":"vidvān","meaning":"the wise"},{"word":"yuktaḥ","meaning":"enlightened"},{"word":"samācharan","meaning":"performing properly"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; buddhi-bhedam—discord in the intellects; janayet—should create; ajñānām—of the ignorant; karma-saṅginām—who are attached to fruitive actions; joṣhayet—should inspire (them) to perform; sarva—all; karmāṇi—prescribed; vidvān—the wise; yuktaḥ—enlightened; samācharan—performing properly'),
('27a68d79-5e98-53c9-9d2b-1ffc15078dc1'::uuid, 3, 27, 146, 146, 'प्रकृतेः क्रियमाणानि गुणैः कर्माणि सर्वशः।

अहङ्कारविमूढात्मा कर्ताऽहमिति मन्यते।।3.27।।', 'prakṛiteḥ kriyamāṇāni guṇaiḥ karmāṇi sarvaśhaḥ
ahankāra-vimūḍhātmā kartāham iti manyate', '[{"word":"prakṛiteḥ","meaning":"of material nature"},{"word":"kriyamāṇāni","meaning":"carried out"},{"word":"guṇaiḥ","meaning":"by the three modes"},{"word":"karmāṇi","meaning":"activities"},{"word":"sarvaśhaḥ","meaning":"all kinds of"},{"word":"ahankāra","meaning":"vimūḍha-ātmā—those who are bewildered by the ego and misidentify themselves with the body"},{"word":"kartā","meaning":"the doer"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"manyate","meaning":"thinks"}]'::jsonb, 'prakṛiteḥ—of material nature; kriyamāṇāni—carried out; guṇaiḥ—by the three modes; karmāṇi—activities; sarvaśhaḥ—all kinds of; ahankāra-vimūḍha-ātmā—those who are bewildered by the ego and misidentify themselves with the body; kartā—the doer; aham—I; iti—thus; manyate—thinks'),
('99499fef-d15b-5d8d-888d-60bd828020cc'::uuid, 3, 28, 147, 147, 'तत्त्ववित्तु महाबाहो गुणकर्मविभागयोः।

गुणा गुणेषु वर्तन्त इति मत्वा न सज्जते।।3.28।।', 'tattva-vit tu mahā-bāho guṇa-karma-vibhāgayoḥ
guṇā guṇeṣhu vartanta iti matvā na sajjate', '[{"word":"tattva","meaning":"vit—the knower of the Truth"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"bāho—mighty-armed one"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"karma—from guṇas and karma"},{"word":"vibhāgayoḥ","meaning":"distinguish"},{"word":"guṇāḥ","meaning":"modes of material nature in the shape of the senses, mind, etc"},{"word":"guṇeṣhu","meaning":"modes of material nature in the shape of objects of perception"},{"word":"vartante","meaning":"are engaged"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"matvā","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"sajjate","meaning":"becomes attached"}]'::jsonb, 'tattva-vit—the knower of the Truth; tu—but; mahā-bāho—mighty-armed one; guṇa-karma—from guṇas and karma; vibhāgayoḥ—distinguish; guṇāḥ—modes of material nature in the shape of the senses, mind, etc; guṇeṣhu—modes of material nature in the shape of objects of perception; vartante—are engaged; iti—thus; matvā—knowing; na—never; sajjate—becomes attached'),
('71a43934-b14f-5993-9477-a132180f2d5e'::uuid, 3, 29, 148, 148, 'प्रकृतेर्गुणसम्मूढाः सज्जन्ते गुणकर्मसु।

तानकृत्स्नविदो मन्दान्कृत्स्नविन्न विचालयेत्।।3.29।।', 'prakṛiter guṇa-sammūḍhāḥ sajjante guṇa-karmasu
tān akṛitsna-vido mandān kṛitsna-vin na vichālayet', '[{"word":"prakṛiteḥ","meaning":"of material nature"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"by the modes of material nature"},{"word":"sammūḍhāḥ","meaning":"deluded"},{"word":"sajjante","meaning":"become attached"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"karmasu—to results of actions"},{"word":"tān","meaning":"those"},{"word":"akṛitsna","meaning":"vidaḥ—persons without knowledge"},{"word":"mandān","meaning":"the ignorant"},{"word":"kṛitsna","meaning":"vit—persons with knowledge"},{"word":"na vichālayet","meaning":"should not unsettle"}]'::jsonb, 'prakṛiteḥ—of material nature; guṇa—by the modes of material nature; sammūḍhāḥ—deluded; sajjante—become attached; guṇa-karmasu—to results of actions; tān—those; akṛitsna-vidaḥ—persons without knowledge; mandān—the ignorant; kṛitsna-vit—persons with knowledge; na vichālayet—should not unsettle'),
('7a4eed63-0cc5-5860-afea-c9976b6dd369'::uuid, 3, 30, 149, 149, 'मयि सर्वाणि कर्माणि संन्यस्याध्यात्मचेतसा।

निराशीर्निर्ममो भूत्वा युध्यस्व विगतज्वरः।।3.30।।', 'mayi sarvāṇi karmāṇi sannyasyādhyātma-chetasā
nirāśhīr nirmamo bhūtvā yudhyasva vigata-jvaraḥ', '[{"word":"mayi","meaning":"unto me"},{"word":"sarvāṇi","meaning":"all"},{"word":"karmāṇi","meaning":"works"},{"word":"sannyasya","meaning":"renouncing completely"},{"word":"adhyātma","meaning":"chetasā—with the thoughts resting on God"},{"word":"nirāśhīḥ","meaning":"free from hankering for the results of the actions"},{"word":"nirmamaḥ","meaning":"without ownership"},{"word":"bhūtvā","meaning":"so being"},{"word":"yudhyasva","meaning":"fight"},{"word":"vigata","meaning":"jvaraḥ—without mental fever"}]'::jsonb, 'mayi—unto me; sarvāṇi—all; karmāṇi—works; sannyasya—renouncing completely; adhyātma-chetasā—with the thoughts resting on God; nirāśhīḥ—free from hankering for the results of the actions; nirmamaḥ—without ownership; bhūtvā—so being; yudhyasva—fight; vigata-jvaraḥ—without mental fever'),
('6fec3a2f-5ba3-5a6c-9b51-b9aab858c5a9'::uuid, 3, 31, 150, 150, 'ये मे मतमिदं नित्यमनुतिष्ठन्ति मानवाः।

श्रद्धावन्तोऽनसूयन्तो मुच्यन्ते तेऽपि कर्मभिः।।3.31।।', 'ye me matam idaṁ nityam anutiṣhṭhanti mānavāḥ
śhraddhāvanto ’nasūyanto muchyante te ’pi karmabhiḥ', '[{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"matam","meaning":"teachings"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"these"},{"word":"nityam","meaning":"constantly"},{"word":"anutiṣhṭhanti","meaning":"abide by"},{"word":"mānavāḥ","meaning":"human beings"},{"word":"śhraddhā","meaning":"vantaḥ—with profound faith"},{"word":"anasūyantaḥ","meaning":"free from cavilling"},{"word":"muchyante","meaning":"become free"},{"word":"te","meaning":"those"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"karmabhiḥ","meaning":"from the bondage of karma"}]'::jsonb, 'ye—who; me—my; matam—teachings; idam—these; nityam—constantly; anutiṣhṭhanti—abide by; mānavāḥ—human beings; śhraddhā-vantaḥ—with profound faith; anasūyantaḥ—free from cavilling; muchyante—become free; te—those; api—also; karmabhiḥ—from the bondage of karma'),
('43030554-33cf-5162-9640-65a7baf17b2a'::uuid, 3, 32, 151, 151, 'ये त्वेतदभ्यसूयन्तो नानुतिष्ठन्ति मे मतम्।

सर्वज्ञानविमूढांस्तान्विद्धि नष्टानचेतसः।।3.32।।', 'ye tvetad abhyasūyanto nānutiṣhṭhanti me matam
sarva-jñāna-vimūḍhāns tān viddhi naṣhṭān achetasaḥ', '[{"word":"ye","meaning":"those"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"etat","meaning":"this"},{"word":"abhyasūyantaḥ","meaning":"cavilling"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"anutiṣhṭhanti","meaning":"follow"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"matam","meaning":"teachings"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"jñāna—in all types of knowledge"},{"word":"vimūḍhān","meaning":"deluded"},{"word":"tān","meaning":"they are"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"naṣhṭān","meaning":"ruined"},{"word":"achetasaḥ","meaning":"devoid of discrimination"}]'::jsonb, 'ye—those; tu—but; etat—this; abhyasūyantaḥ—cavilling; na—not; anutiṣhṭhanti—follow; me—my; matam—teachings; sarva-jñāna—in all types of knowledge; vimūḍhān—deluded; tān—they are; viddhi—know; naṣhṭān—ruined; achetasaḥ—devoid of discrimination'),
('f8cd7d2c-d38e-5ffc-873d-e50ff9b5891e'::uuid, 3, 33, 152, 152, 'सदृशं चेष्टते स्वस्याः प्रकृतेर्ज्ञानवानपि।

प्रकृतिं यान्ति भूतानि निग्रहः किं करिष्यति।।3.33।।', 'sadṛiśhaṁ cheṣhṭate svasyāḥ prakṛiter jñānavān api
prakṛitiṁ yānti bhūtāni nigrahaḥ kiṁ kariṣhyati', '[{"word":"sadṛiśham","meaning":"accordingly"},{"word":"cheṣhṭate","meaning":"act"},{"word":"svasyāḥ","meaning":"by their own"},{"word":"prakṛiteḥ","meaning":"modes of nature"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"vān—the wise"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"prakṛitim","meaning":"nature"},{"word":"yānti","meaning":"follow"},{"word":"bhūtāni","meaning":"all living beings"},{"word":"nigrahaḥ","meaning":"repression"},{"word":"kim","meaning":"what"},{"word":"kariṣhyati","meaning":"will do"}]'::jsonb, 'sadṛiśham—accordingly; cheṣhṭate—act; svasyāḥ—by their own; prakṛiteḥ—modes of nature; jñāna-vān—the wise; api—even; prakṛitim—nature; yānti—follow; bhūtāni—all living beings; nigrahaḥ—repression; kim—what; kariṣhyati—will do'),
('c203770a-c9c0-5c1b-bf34-7c48182df501'::uuid, 3, 34, 153, 153, 'इन्द्रियस्येन्द्रियस्यार्थे रागद्वेषौ व्यवस्थितौ।

तयोर्न वशमागच्छेत्तौ ह्यस्य परिपन्थिनौ।।3.34।।', 'indriyasyendriyasyārthe rāga-dveṣhau vyavasthitau
tayor na vaśham āgachchhet tau hyasya paripanthinau', '[{"word":"indriyasya","meaning":"of the senses"},{"word":"indriyasya arthe","meaning":"in the sense objects"},{"word":"rāga","meaning":"attachment"},{"word":"dveṣhau","meaning":"aversion"},{"word":"vyavasthitau","meaning":"situated"},{"word":"tayoḥ","meaning":"of them"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"vaśham","meaning":"be controlled"},{"word":"āgachchhet","meaning":"should become"},{"word":"tau","meaning":"those"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"asya","meaning":"for him"},{"word":"paripanthinau","meaning":"foes"}]'::jsonb, 'indriyasya—of the senses; indriyasya arthe—in the sense objects; rāga—attachment; dveṣhau—aversion; vyavasthitau—situated; tayoḥ—of them; na—never; vaśham—be controlled; āgachchhet—should become; tau—those; hi—certainly; asya—for him; paripanthinau—foes'),
