('0406722a-08cd-5cec-a0f5-9cba4e5aac9a'::uuid, 4, 4, 166, 166, 'अर्जुन उवाच

अपरं भवतो जन्म परं जन्म विवस्वतः।

कथमेतद्विजानीयां त्वमादौ प्रोक्तवानिति।।4.4।।', 'arjuna uvācha
aparaṁ bhavato janma paraṁ janma vivasvataḥ
katham etad vijānīyāṁ tvam ādau proktavān iti', '[{"word":"arjunaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Arjun said"},{"word":"aparam","meaning":"later"},{"word":"bhavataḥ","meaning":"your"},{"word":"janma","meaning":"birth"},{"word":"param","meaning":"prior"},{"word":"janma","meaning":"birth"},{"word":"vivasvataḥ","meaning":"Vivasvan, the sun-god"},{"word":"katham","meaning":"how"},{"word":"etat","meaning":"this"},{"word":"vijānīyām","meaning":"am I to understand"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"ādau","meaning":"in the beginning"},{"word":"proktavān","meaning":"taught"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"}]'::jsonb, 'arjunaḥ uvācha—Arjun said; aparam—later; bhavataḥ—your; janma—birth; param—prior; janma—birth; vivasvataḥ—Vivasvan, the sun-god; katham—how; etat—this; vijānīyām—am I to understand; tvam—you; ādau—in the beginning; proktavān—taught; iti—thus'),
('04f116d4-7eb9-58bd-97b6-7418ef1cf10d'::uuid, 4, 5, 167, 167, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

बहूनि मे व्यतीतानि जन्मानि तव चार्जुन।

तान्यहं वेद सर्वाणि न त्वं वेत्थ परन्तप।।4.5।।', 'śhrī bhagavān uvācha
bahūni me vyatītāni janmāni tava chārjuna
tānyahaṁ veda sarvāṇi na tvaṁ vettha parantapa', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said"},{"word":"bahūni","meaning":"many"},{"word":"me","meaning":"of mine"},{"word":"vyatītāni","meaning":"have passed"},{"word":"janmāni","meaning":"births"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"of yours"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"tāni","meaning":"them"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"veda","meaning":"know"},{"word":"sarvāṇi","meaning":"all"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"vettha","meaning":"know"},{"word":"parantapa","meaning":"Arjun, the scorcher of foes"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said; bahūni—many; me—of mine; vyatītāni—have passed; janmāni—births; tava—of yours; cha—and; arjuna—Arjun; tāni—them; aham—I; veda—know; sarvāṇi—all; na—not; tvam—you; vettha—know; parantapa—Arjun, the scorcher of foes'),
('cbc51231-994a-5664-83e0-3cecc2d04992'::uuid, 4, 6, 168, 168, 'अजोऽपि सन्नव्ययात्मा भूतानामीश्वरोऽपि सन्।

प्रकृतिं स्वामधिष्ठाय संभवाम्यात्ममायया।।4.6।।', 'ajo ’pi sannavyayātmā bhūtānām īśhvaro ’pi san
prakṛitiṁ svām adhiṣhṭhāya sambhavāmyātma-māyayā', '[{"word":"ajaḥ","meaning":"unborn"},{"word":"api","meaning":"although"},{"word":"san","meaning":"being so"},{"word":"avyaya ātmā","meaning":"Imperishable nature"},{"word":"bhūtānām","meaning":"of (all) beings"},{"word":"īśhvaraḥ","meaning":"the Lord"},{"word":"api","meaning":"although"},{"word":"san","meaning":"being"},{"word":"prakṛitim","meaning":"nature"},{"word":"svām","meaning":"of myself"},{"word":"adhiṣhṭhāya","meaning":"situated"},{"word":"sambhavāmi","meaning":"I manifest"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"māyayā—by my Yogmaya power"}]'::jsonb, 'ajaḥ—unborn; api—although; san—being so; avyaya ātmā—Imperishable nature; bhūtānām—of (all) beings; īśhvaraḥ—the Lord; api—although; san—being; prakṛitim—nature; svām—of myself; adhiṣhṭhāya—situated; sambhavāmi—I manifest; ātma-māyayā—by my Yogmaya power'),
('a2d25b2f-d1e9-5927-8648-5ed81c80ef3a'::uuid, 4, 7, 169, 169, 'यदा यदा हि धर्मस्य ग्लानिर्भवति भारत।

अभ्युत्थानमधर्मस्य तदाऽऽत्मानं सृजाम्यहम्।।4.7।।', 'yadā yadā hi dharmasya glānir bhavati bhārata
abhyutthānam adharmasya tadātmānaṁ sṛijāmyaham', '[{"word":"yadā yadā","meaning":"whenever"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"dharmasya","meaning":"of righteousness"},{"word":"glāniḥ","meaning":"decline"},{"word":"bhavati","meaning":"is"},{"word":"bhārata","meaning":"Arjun, descendant of Bharat"},{"word":"abhyutthānam","meaning":"increase"},{"word":"adharmasya","meaning":"of unrighteousness"},{"word":"tadā","meaning":"at that time"},{"word":"ātmānam","meaning":"self"},{"word":"sṛijāmi","meaning":"manifest"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'yadā yadā—whenever; hi—certainly; dharmasya—of righteousness; glāniḥ—decline; bhavati—is; bhārata—Arjun, descendant of Bharat; abhyutthānam—increase; adharmasya—of unrighteousness; tadā—at that time; ātmānam—self; sṛijāmi—manifest; aham—I'),
('7f287d89-3364-59e5-b82a-506f77271cd8'::uuid, 4, 8, 170, 170, 'परित्राणाय साधूनां विनाशाय च दुष्कृताम्।

धर्मसंस्थापनार्थाय संभवामि युगे युगे।।4.8।।', 'paritrāṇāya sādhūnāṁ vināśhāya cha duṣhkṛitām
dharma-sansthāpanārthāya sambhavāmi yuge yuge', '[{"word":"paritrāṇāya","meaning":"to protect"},{"word":"sādhūnām","meaning":"the righteous"},{"word":"vināśhāya","meaning":"to annihilate"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"duṣhkṛitām","meaning":"the wicked"},{"word":"dharma","meaning":"the eternal religion"},{"word":"sansthāpana","meaning":"arthāya—to reestablish"},{"word":"sambhavāmi","meaning":"I appear"},{"word":"yuge yuge","meaning":"age after age"}]'::jsonb, 'paritrāṇāya—to protect; sādhūnām—the righteous; vināśhāya—to annihilate; cha—and; duṣhkṛitām—the wicked; dharma—the eternal religion; sansthāpana-arthāya—to reestablish; sambhavāmi—I appear; yuge yuge—age after age'),
('3b25fea4-d31a-5046-800a-30555c85dfed'::uuid, 4, 9, 171, 171, 'जन्म कर्म च मे दिव्यमेवं यो वेत्ति तत्त्वतः।

त्यक्त्वा देहं पुनर्जन्म नैति मामेति सोऽर्जुन।।4.9।।', 'janma karma cha me divyam evaṁ yo vetti tattvataḥ
tyaktvā dehaṁ punar janma naiti mām eti so ’rjuna', '[{"word":"janma","meaning":"birth"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"activities"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"me","meaning":"of mine"},{"word":"divyam","meaning":"divine"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"vetti","meaning":"know"},{"word":"tattvataḥ","meaning":"in truth"},{"word":"tyaktvā","meaning":"having abandoned"},{"word":"deham","meaning":"the body"},{"word":"punaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"janma","meaning":"birth"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"eti","meaning":"takes"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"eti","meaning":"comes"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"}]'::jsonb, 'janma—birth; karma—activities; cha—and; me—of mine; divyam—divine; evam—thus; yaḥ—who; vetti—know; tattvataḥ—in truth; tyaktvā—having abandoned; deham—the body; punaḥ—again; janma—birth; na—never; eti—takes; mām—to me; eti—comes; saḥ—he; arjuna—Arjun'),
('649d2bb9-2a09-56da-8dcc-a2ea1aed3b40'::uuid, 4, 10, 172, 172, 'वीतरागभयक्रोधा मन्मया मामुपाश्रिताः।

बहवो ज्ञानतपसा पूता मद्भावमागताः।।4.10।।', 'vīta-rāga-bhaya-krodhā man-mayā mām upāśhritāḥ
bahavo jñāna-tapasā pūtā mad-bhāvam āgatāḥ', '[{"word":"vīta","meaning":"freed from"},{"word":"rāga","meaning":"attachment"},{"word":"bhaya","meaning":"fear"},{"word":"krodhāḥ","meaning":"and anger"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"mayā—completely absorbed in me"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"in me"},{"word":"upāśhritāḥ","meaning":"taking refuge (of)"},{"word":"bahavaḥ","meaning":"many (persons)"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"of knowledge"},{"word":"tapasā","meaning":"by the fire of knowledge"},{"word":"pūtāḥ","meaning":"purified"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"bhāvam—my divine love"},{"word":"āgatāḥ","meaning":"attained"}]'::jsonb, 'vīta—freed from; rāga—attachment; bhaya—fear; krodhāḥ—and anger; mat-mayā—completely absorbed in me; mām—in me; upāśhritāḥ—taking refuge (of); bahavaḥ—many (persons); jñāna—of knowledge; tapasā—by the fire of knowledge; pūtāḥ—purified; mat-bhāvam—my divine love; āgatāḥ—attained'),
('0c21c7ba-8a37-5a2a-babd-8fa261b8d120'::uuid, 4, 11, 173, 173, 'ये यथा मां प्रपद्यन्ते तांस्तथैव भजाम्यहम्।

मम वर्त्मानुवर्तन्ते मनुष्याः पार्थ सर्वशः।।4.11।।', 'ye yathā māṁ prapadyante tāns tathaiva bhajāmyaham
mama vartmānuvartante manuṣhyāḥ pārtha sarvaśhaḥ', '[{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"yathā","meaning":"in whatever way"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"unto me"},{"word":"prapadyante","meaning":"surrender"},{"word":"tān","meaning":"them"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"so"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"bhajāmi","meaning":"reciprocate"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"vartma","meaning":"path"},{"word":"anuvartante","meaning":"follow"},{"word":"manuṣhyāḥ","meaning":"men"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"sarvaśhaḥ","meaning":"in all respects"}]'::jsonb, 'ye—who; yathā—in whatever way; mām—unto me; prapadyante—surrender; tān—them; tathā—so; eva—certainly; bhajāmi—reciprocate; aham—I; mama—my; vartma—path; anuvartante—follow; manuṣhyāḥ—men; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; sarvaśhaḥ—in all respects'),
('c1c95996-41f2-54ee-92c1-1964e0ff6c05'::uuid, 4, 12, 174, 174, 'काङ्क्षन्तः कर्मणां सिद्धिं यजन्त इह देवताः।

क्षिप्रं हि मानुषे लोके सिद्धिर्भवति कर्मजा।।4.12।।', 'kāṅkṣhantaḥ karmaṇāṁ siddhiṁ yajanta iha devatāḥ
kṣhipraṁ hi mānuṣhe loke siddhir bhavati karmajā', '[{"word":"kāṅkṣhantaḥ","meaning":"desiring"},{"word":"karmaṇām","meaning":"material activities"},{"word":"siddhim","meaning":"success"},{"word":"yajante","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"in this world"},{"word":"devatāḥ","meaning":"the celestial gods"},{"word":"kṣhipram","meaning":"quickly"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"mānuṣhe","meaning":"in human society"},{"word":"loke","meaning":"within this world"},{"word":"siddhiḥ","meaning":"rewarding"},{"word":"bhavati","meaning":"manifest"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"jā—from material activities"}]'::jsonb, 'kāṅkṣhantaḥ—desiring; karmaṇām—material activities; siddhim—success; yajante—worship; iha—in this world; devatāḥ—the celestial gods; kṣhipram—quickly; hi—certainly; mānuṣhe—in human society; loke—within this world; siddhiḥ—rewarding; bhavati—manifest; karma-jā—from material activities'),
('96c72b16-b8cd-51e8-b4b6-b49d277a2206'::uuid, 4, 13, 175, 175, 'चातुर्वर्ण्यं मया सृष्टं गुणकर्मविभागशः।

तस्य कर्तारमपि मां विद्ध्यकर्तारमव्ययम्।।4.13।।', 'chātur-varṇyaṁ mayā sṛiṣhṭaṁ guṇa-karma-vibhāgaśhaḥ
tasya kartāram api māṁ viddhyakartāram avyayam', '[{"word":"chātuḥ","meaning":"varṇyam—the four categories of occupations"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"sṛiṣhṭam","meaning":"were created"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"of quality"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"and activities"},{"word":"vibhāgaśhaḥ","meaning":"according to divisions"},{"word":"tasya","meaning":"of that"},{"word":"kartāram","meaning":"the creator"},{"word":"api","meaning":"although"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"akartāram","meaning":"non-doer"},{"word":"avyayam","meaning":"unchangeable"}]'::jsonb, 'chātuḥ-varṇyam—the four categories of occupations; mayā—by me; sṛiṣhṭam—were created; guṇa—of quality; karma—and activities; vibhāgaśhaḥ—according to divisions; tasya—of that; kartāram—the creator; api—although; mām—me; viddhi—know; akartāram—non-doer; avyayam—unchangeable'),
('70f614a9-4c4d-5428-ab24-7f3d6778f704'::uuid, 4, 14, 176, 176, 'न मां कर्माणि लिम्पन्ति न मे कर्मफले स्पृहा।

इति मां योऽभिजानाति कर्मभिर्न स बध्यते।।4.14।।', 'na māṁ karmāṇi limpanti na me karma-phale spṛihā
iti māṁ yo ’bhijānāti karmabhir na sa badhyate', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"karmāṇi","meaning":"activities"},{"word":"limpanti","meaning":"taint"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"phale—the fruits of action"},{"word":"spṛihā","meaning":"desire"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"abhijānāti","meaning":"knows"},{"word":"karmabhiḥ","meaning":"result of action"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"that person"},{"word":"badhyate","meaning":"is bound"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; mām—me; karmāṇi—activities; limpanti—taint; na—nor; me—my; karma-phale—the fruits of action; spṛihā—desire; iti—thus; mām—me; yaḥ—who; abhijānāti—knows; karmabhiḥ—result of action; na—never; saḥ—that person; badhyate—is bound'),
('0498534f-e85a-5216-8c8b-146f6dbae8c3'::uuid, 4, 15, 177, 177, 'एवं ज्ञात्वा कृतं कर्म पूर्वैरपि मुमुक्षुभिः।

कुरु कर्मैव तस्मात्त्वं पूर्वैः पूर्वतरं कृतम्।।4.15।।', 'evaṁ jñātvā kṛitaṁ karma pūrvair api mumukṣhubhiḥ
kuru karmaiva tasmāttvaṁ pūrvaiḥ pūrvataraṁ kṛitam', '[{"word":"evam","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"kṛitam","meaning":"performed"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"actions"},{"word":"pūrvaiḥ","meaning":"of ancient times"},{"word":"api","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"mumukṣhubhiḥ","meaning":"seekers of liberation"},{"word":"kuru","meaning":"should perform"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"pūrvaiḥ","meaning":"of those ancient sages"},{"word":"pūrva","meaning":"taram—in ancient times"},{"word":"kṛitam","meaning":"performed"}]'::jsonb, 'evam—thus; jñātvā—knowing; kṛitam—performed; karma—actions; pūrvaiḥ—of ancient times; api—indeed; mumukṣhubhiḥ—seekers of liberation; kuru—should perform; karma—duty; eva—certainly; tasmāt—therefore; tvam—you; pūrvaiḥ—of those ancient sages; pūrva-taram—in ancient times; kṛitam—performed'),
('1f99e228-6b42-55d8-9e60-417f413927c6'::uuid, 4, 16, 178, 178, 'किं कर्म किमकर्मेति कवयोऽप्यत्र मोहिताः।

तत्ते कर्म प्रवक्ष्यामि यज्ज्ञात्वा मोक्ष्यसेऽशुभात्।।4.16।।', 'kiṁ karma kim akarmeti kavayo ’pyatra mohitāḥ
tat te karma pravakṣhyāmi yaj jñātvā mokṣhyase ’śhubhāt', '[{"word":"kim","meaning":"what"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"kim","meaning":"what"},{"word":"akarma","meaning":"inaction"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"kavayaḥ","meaning":"the wise"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"atra","meaning":"in this"},{"word":"mohitāḥ","meaning":"are confused"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"pravakṣhyāmi","meaning":"I shall explain"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"mokṣhyase","meaning":"you may free yourself"},{"word":"aśhubhāt","meaning":"from inauspiciousness"}]'::jsonb, 'kim—what; karma—action; kim—what; akarma—inaction; iti—thus; kavayaḥ—the wise; api—even; atra—in this; mohitāḥ—are confused; tat—that; te—to you; karma—action; pravakṣhyāmi—I shall explain; yat—which; jñātvā—knowing; mokṣhyase—you may free yourself; aśhubhāt—from inauspiciousness'),
('9b46f2d0-d829-514d-85cf-068dc3ef5b02'::uuid, 4, 17, 179, 179, 'कर्मणो ह्यपि बोद्धव्यं बोद्धव्यं च विकर्मणः।

अकर्मणश्च बोद्धव्यं गहना कर्मणो गतिः।।4.17।।', 'karmaṇo hyapi boddhavyaṁ boddhavyaṁ cha vikarmaṇaḥ
akarmaṇaśh cha boddhavyaṁ gahanā karmaṇo gatiḥ', '[{"word":"karmaṇaḥ","meaning":"recommended action"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"boddhavyam","meaning":"should be known"},{"word":"boddhavyam","meaning":"must understand"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"vikarmaṇaḥ","meaning":"forbidden action"},{"word":"akarmaṇaḥ","meaning":"inaction"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"boddhavyam","meaning":"must understand"},{"word":"gahanā","meaning":"profound"},{"word":"karmaṇaḥ","meaning":"of action"},{"word":"gatiḥ","meaning":"the true path"}]'::jsonb, 'karmaṇaḥ—recommended action; hi—certainly; api—also; boddhavyam—should be known; boddhavyam—must understand; cha—and; vikarmaṇaḥ—forbidden action; akarmaṇaḥ—inaction; cha—and; boddhavyam—must understand; gahanā—profound; karmaṇaḥ—of action; gatiḥ—the true path'),
('b3848acf-7137-51c6-811d-417d0555f728'::uuid, 4, 18, 180, 180, 'कर्मण्यकर्म यः पश्येदकर्मणि च कर्म यः।

स बुद्धिमान् मनुष्येषु स युक्तः कृत्स्नकर्मकृत्।।4.18।।', 'karmaṇyakarma yaḥ paśhyed akarmaṇi cha karma yaḥ
sa buddhimān manuṣhyeṣhu sa yuktaḥ kṛitsna-karma-kṛit', '[{"word":"karmaṇi","meaning":"action"},{"word":"akarma","meaning":"in inaction"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"paśhyet","meaning":"see"},{"word":"akarmaṇi","meaning":"inaction"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"action"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"buddhi","meaning":"mān—wise"},{"word":"manuṣhyeṣhu","meaning":"amongst humans"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"they"},{"word":"yuktaḥ","meaning":"yogis"},{"word":"kṛitsna","meaning":"karma-kṛit—performers all kinds of actions"}]'::jsonb, 'karmaṇi—action; akarma—in inaction; yaḥ—who; paśhyet—see; akarmaṇi—inaction; cha—also; karma—action; yaḥ—who; saḥ—they; buddhi-mān—wise; manuṣhyeṣhu—amongst humans; saḥ—they; yuktaḥ—yogis; kṛitsna-karma-kṛit—performers all kinds of actions'),
('eeff6e02-b5df-5085-9658-fb76a1ecbd70'::uuid, 4, 19, 181, 181, 'यस्य सर्वे समारम्भाः कामसङ्कल्पवर्जिताः।

ज्ञानाग्निदग्धकर्माणं तमाहुः पण्डितं बुधाः।।4.19।।', 'yasya sarve samārambhāḥ kāma-saṅkalpa-varjitāḥ
jñānāgni-dagdha-karmāṇaṁ tam āhuḥ paṇḍitaṁ budhāḥ', '[{"word":"yasya","meaning":"whose"},{"word":"sarve","meaning":"every"},{"word":"samārambhāḥ","meaning":"undertakings"},{"word":"kāma","meaning":"desire for material pleasures"},{"word":"saṅkalpa","meaning":"resolve"},{"word":"varjitāḥ","meaning":"devoid of"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"divine knowledge"},{"word":"agni","meaning":"in the fire"},{"word":"dagdha","meaning":"burnt"},{"word":"karmāṇam","meaning":"actions"},{"word":"tam","meaning":"him"},{"word":"āhuḥ","meaning":"address"},{"word":"paṇḍitam","meaning":"a sage"},{"word":"budhāḥ","meaning":"the wise"}]'::jsonb, 'yasya—whose; sarve—every; samārambhāḥ—undertakings; kāma—desire for material pleasures; saṅkalpa—resolve; varjitāḥ—devoid of; jñāna—divine knowledge; agni—in the fire; dagdha—burnt; karmāṇam—actions; tam—him; āhuḥ—address; paṇḍitam—a sage; budhāḥ—the wise'),
('b969ae28-b184-5622-9dd6-d807b65459c0'::uuid, 4, 20, 182, 182, 'त्यक्त्वा कर्मफलासङ्गं नित्यतृप्तो निराश्रयः।

कर्मण्यभिप्रवृत्तोऽपि नैव किञ्चित्करोति सः।।4.20।।', 'tyaktvā karma-phalāsaṅgaṁ nitya-tṛipto nirāśhrayaḥ
karmaṇyabhipravṛitto ’pi naiva kiñchit karoti saḥ', '[{"word":"tyaktvā","meaning":"having given up"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"phala-āsaṅgam—attachment to the fruits of action"},{"word":"nitya","meaning":"always"},{"word":"tṛiptaḥ","meaning":"satisfied"},{"word":"nirāśhrayaḥ","meaning":"without dependence"},{"word":"karmaṇi","meaning":"in activities"},{"word":"abhipravṛittaḥ","meaning":"engaged"},{"word":"api","meaning":"despite"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"kiñchit","meaning":"anything"},{"word":"karoti","meaning":"do"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"that person"}]'::jsonb, 'tyaktvā—having given up; karma-phala-āsaṅgam—attachment to the fruits of action; nitya—always; tṛiptaḥ—satisfied; nirāśhrayaḥ—without dependence; karmaṇi—in activities; abhipravṛittaḥ—engaged; api—despite; na—not; eva—certainly; kiñchit—anything; karoti—do; saḥ—that person'),
('d302664b-254b-5530-b3cf-053ba95ccf81'::uuid, 4, 21, 183, 183, 'निराशीर्यतचित्तात्मा त्यक्तसर्वपरिग्रहः।

शारीरं केवलं कर्म कुर्वन्नाप्नोति किल्बिषम्।।4.21।।', 'nirāśhīr yata-chittātmā tyakta-sarva-parigrahaḥ
śhārīraṁ kevalaṁ karma kurvan nāpnoti kilbiṣham', '[{"word":"nirāśhīḥ","meaning":"free from expectations"},{"word":"yata","meaning":"controlled"},{"word":"chitta","meaning":"ātmā—mind and intellect"},{"word":"tyakta","meaning":"having abandoned"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"all"},{"word":"parigrahaḥ","meaning":"the sense of ownership"},{"word":"śhārīram","meaning":"bodily"},{"word":"kevalam","meaning":"only"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"actions"},{"word":"kurvan","meaning":"performing"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"āpnoti","meaning":"incurs"},{"word":"kilbiṣham","meaning":"sin"}]'::jsonb, 'nirāśhīḥ—free from expectations; yata—controlled; chitta-ātmā—mind and intellect; tyakta—having abandoned; sarva—all; parigrahaḥ—the sense of ownership; śhārīram—bodily; kevalam—only; karma—actions; kurvan—performing; na—never; āpnoti—incurs; kilbiṣham—sin'),
('c73d34bb-3e4d-5522-ae02-b950ddfdfa47'::uuid, 4, 22, 184, 184, 'यदृच्छालाभसन्तुष्टो द्वन्द्वातीतो विमत्सरः।

समः सिद्धावसिद्धौ च कृत्वापि न निबध्यते।।4.22।।', 'yadṛichchhā-lābha-santuṣhṭo dvandvātīto vimatsaraḥ
