('c59ebaaa-4cad-5a24-b61a-63b45113e007'::uuid, 7, 2, 282, 282, 'ज्ञानं तेऽहं सविज्ञानमिदं वक्ष्याम्यशेषतः।

यज्ज्ञात्वा नेह भूयोऽन्यज्ज्ञातव्यमवशिष्यते।।7.2।।', 'jñānaṁ te ’haṁ sa-vijñānam idaṁ vakṣhyāmyaśheṣhataḥ
yaj jñātvā neha bhūyo ’nyaj jñātavyam-avaśhiṣhyate', '[{"word":"jñānam","meaning":"knowledge"},{"word":"te","meaning":"unto you"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"sa","meaning":"with"},{"word":"vijñānam","meaning":"wisdom"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"vakṣhyāmi","meaning":"shall reveal"},{"word":"aśheṣhataḥ","meaning":"in full"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"having known"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"in this world"},{"word":"bhūyaḥ","meaning":"further"},{"word":"anyat","meaning":"anything else"},{"word":"jñātavyam","meaning":"to be known"},{"word":"avaśhiṣhyate","meaning":"remains"}]'::jsonb, 'jñānam—knowledge; te—unto you; aham—I; sa—with; vijñānam—wisdom; idam—this; vakṣhyāmi—shall reveal; aśheṣhataḥ—in full; yat—which; jñātvā—having known; na—not; iha—in this world; bhūyaḥ—further; anyat—anything else; jñātavyam—to be known; avaśhiṣhyate—remains'),
('8a7c9bb0-7762-5d86-b4ca-3bafe4883617'::uuid, 7, 3, 283, 283, 'मनुष्याणां सहस्रेषु कश्िचद्यतति सिद्धये।

यततामपि सिद्धानां कश्िचन्मां वेत्ति तत्त्वतः।।7.3।।', 'manuṣhyāṇāṁ sahasreṣhu kaśhchid yatati siddhaye
