('50cb55eb-fe26-5ff0-b8e9-05af6bd0eddb'::uuid, 7, 5, 285, 285, 'अपरेयमितस्त्वन्यां प्रकृतिं विद्धि मे पराम्।

जीवभूतां महाबाहो ययेदं धार्यते जगत्।।7.5।।', 'apareyam itas tvanyāṁ prakṛitiṁ viddhi me parām
jīva-bhūtāṁ mahā-bāho yayedaṁ dhāryate jagat', '[{"word":"aparā","meaning":"inferior"},{"word":"iyam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"itaḥ","meaning":"besides this"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"anyām","meaning":"another"},{"word":"prakṛitim","meaning":"energy"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"parām","meaning":"superior"},{"word":"jīva","meaning":"bhūtām—living beings"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"bāho—mighty-armed one"},{"word":"yayā","meaning":"by whom"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"dhāryate","meaning":"the basis"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"the material world"}]'::jsonb, 'aparā—inferior; iyam—this; itaḥ—besides this; tu—but; anyām—another; prakṛitim—energy; viddhi—know; me—my; parām—superior; jīva-bhūtām—living beings; mahā-bāho—mighty-armed one; yayā—by whom; idam—this; dhāryate—the basis; jagat—the material world'),
('a1dcf370-e869-5adb-bf77-8e08bdee035c'::uuid, 7, 6, 286, 286, 'एतद्योनीनि भूतानि सर्वाणीत्युपधारय।

अहं कृत्स्नस्य जगतः प्रभवः प्रलयस्तथा।।7.6।।', 'etad-yonīni bhūtāni sarvāṇītyupadhāraya
ahaṁ kṛitsnasya jagataḥ prabhavaḥ pralayas tathā', '[{"word":"etat yonīni","meaning":"these two (energies) are the source of"},{"word":"bhūtāni","meaning":"living beings"},{"word":"sarvāṇi","meaning":"all"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"that"},{"word":"upadhāraya","meaning":"know"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"kṛitsnasya","meaning":"entire"},{"word":"jagataḥ","meaning":"creation"},{"word":"prabhavaḥ","meaning":"the source"},{"word":"pralayaḥ","meaning":"dissolution"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"and"}]'::jsonb, 'etat yonīni—these two (energies) are the source of; bhūtāni—living beings; sarvāṇi—all; iti—that; upadhāraya—know; aham—I; kṛitsnasya—entire; jagataḥ—creation; prabhavaḥ—the source; pralayaḥ—dissolution; tathā—and'),
('29bc17bd-599a-5c8a-8b06-942b190fe6c1'::uuid, 7, 7, 287, 287, 'मत्तः परतरं नान्यत्किञ्चिदस्ति धनञ्जय।

मयि सर्वमिदं प्रोतं सूत्रे मणिगणा इव।।7.7।।', 'mattaḥ parataraṁ nānyat kiñchid asti dhanañjaya
mayi sarvam idaṁ protaṁ sūtre maṇi-gaṇā iva', '[{"word":"mattaḥ","meaning":"than me"},{"word":"para","meaning":"taram—superior"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"anyat kiñchit","meaning":"anything else"},{"word":"asti","meaning":"there is"},{"word":"dhanañjaya","meaning":"Arjun, conqueror of wealth"},{"word":"mayi","meaning":"in me"},{"word":"sarvam","meaning":"all"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"which we see"},{"word":"protam","meaning":"is strung"},{"word":"sūtre","meaning":"on a thread"},{"word":"maṇi","meaning":"gaṇāḥ—beads"},{"word":"iva","meaning":"like"}]'::jsonb, 'mattaḥ—than me; para-taram—superior; na—not; anyat kiñchit—anything else; asti—there is; dhanañjaya—Arjun, conqueror of wealth; mayi—in me; sarvam—all; idam—which we see; protam—is strung; sūtre—on a thread; maṇi-gaṇāḥ—beads; iva—like'),
('5a408a70-84dd-5a72-a746-528fac13942e'::uuid, 7, 8, 288, 288, 'रसोऽहमप्सु कौन्तेय प्रभास्मि शशिसूर्ययोः।

प्रणवः सर्ववेदेषु शब्दः खे पौरुषं नृषु।।7.8।।', 'raso ’ham apsu kaunteya prabhāsmi śhaśhi-sūryayoḥ
praṇavaḥ sarva-vedeṣhu śhabdaḥ khe pauruṣhaṁ nṛiṣhu', '[{"word":"rasaḥ","meaning":"taste"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"apsu","meaning":"in water"},{"word":"kaunteya","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Kunti"},{"word":"prabhā","meaning":"the radiance"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"śhaśhi","meaning":"sūryayoḥ—of the moon and the sun"},{"word":"praṇavaḥ","meaning":"the sacred syllable Om"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"in all"},{"word":"vedeṣhu","meaning":"Vedas"},{"word":"śhabdaḥ","meaning":"sound"},{"word":"khe","meaning":"in ether"},{"word":"pauruṣham","meaning":"ability"},{"word":"nṛiṣhu","meaning":"in humans"}]'::jsonb, 'rasaḥ—taste; aham—I; apsu—in water; kaunteya—Arjun, the son of Kunti; prabhā—the radiance; asmi—I am; śhaśhi-sūryayoḥ—of the moon and the sun; praṇavaḥ—the sacred syllable Om; sarva—in all; vedeṣhu—Vedas; śhabdaḥ—sound; khe—in ether; pauruṣham—ability; nṛiṣhu—in humans'),
('85f39e76-284a-56a2-8104-0b6fbc08bf97'::uuid, 7, 9, 289, 289, 'पुण्यो गन्धः पृथिव्यां च तेजश्चास्मि विभावसौ।

जीवनं सर्वभूतेषु तपश्चास्मि तपस्विषु।।7.9।।', 'puṇyo gandhaḥ pṛithivyāṁ cha tejaśh chāsmi vibhāvasau
jīvanaṁ sarva-bhūteṣhu tapaśh chāsmi tapasviṣhu', '[{"word":"puṇyaḥ","meaning":"pure"},{"word":"gandhaḥ","meaning":"fragrance"},{"word":"pṛithivyām","meaning":"of the earth"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"brilliance"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"vibhāvasau","meaning":"in the fire"},{"word":"jīvanam","meaning":"the life-force"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"in all"},{"word":"bhūteṣhu","meaning":"beings"},{"word":"tapaḥ","meaning":"penance"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"tapasviṣhu","meaning":"of the ascetics"}]'::jsonb, 'puṇyaḥ—pure; gandhaḥ—fragrance; pṛithivyām—of the earth; cha—and; tejaḥ—brilliance; cha—and; asmi—I am; vibhāvasau—in the fire; jīvanam—the life-force; sarva—in all; bhūteṣhu—beings; tapaḥ—penance; cha—and; asmi—I am; tapasviṣhu—of the ascetics'),
('1ec52b38-4a62-5228-836e-8228c38468a5'::uuid, 7, 10, 290, 290, 'बीजं मां सर्वभूतानां विद्धि पार्थ सनातनम्।

बुद्धिर्बुद्धिमतामस्मि तेजस्तेजस्विनामहम्।।7.10।।', 'bījaṁ māṁ sarva-bhūtānāṁ viddhi pārtha sanātanam
buddhir buddhimatām asmi tejas tejasvinām aham', '[{"word":"bījam","meaning":"the seed"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūtānām—of all beings"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"sanātanam","meaning":"the eternal"},{"word":"buddhiḥ","meaning":"intellect"},{"word":"buddhi","meaning":"matām—of the intelligent"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"(I) am"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"splendor"},{"word":"tejasvinām","meaning":"of the splendid"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'bījam—the seed; mām—me; sarva-bhūtānām—of all beings; viddhi—know; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; sanātanam—the eternal; buddhiḥ—intellect; buddhi-matām—of the intelligent; asmi—(I) am; tejaḥ—splendor; tejasvinām—of the splendid; aham—I'),
('0da6d08b-3273-5f28-bde6-f90f9177817b'::uuid, 7, 11, 291, 291, 'बलं बलवतां चाहं कामरागविवर्जितम्।

धर्माविरुद्धो भूतेषु कामोऽस्मि भरतर्षभ।।7.11।।', 'balaṁ balavatāṁ chāhaṁ kāma-rāga-vivarjitam
dharmāviruddho bhūteṣhu kāmo ’smi bharatarṣhabha', '[{"word":"balam","meaning":"strength"},{"word":"bala","meaning":"vatām—of the strong"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"kāma","meaning":"desire"},{"word":"rāga","meaning":"passion"},{"word":"vivarjitam","meaning":"devoid of"},{"word":"dharma","meaning":"aviruddhaḥ—not conflicting with dharma"},{"word":"bhūteṣhu","meaning":"in all beings"},{"word":"kāmaḥ","meaning":"sexual activity"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"(I) am"},{"word":"bharata","meaning":"ṛiṣhabha—Arjun, the best of the Bharats"}]'::jsonb, 'balam—strength; bala-vatām—of the strong; cha—and; aham—I; kāma—desire; rāga—passion; vivarjitam—devoid of; dharma-aviruddhaḥ—not conflicting with dharma; bhūteṣhu—in all beings; kāmaḥ—sexual activity; asmi—(I) am; bharata-ṛiṣhabha—Arjun, the best of the Bharats'),
('9f835ba3-7827-5cdc-b515-916bd5fbe546'::uuid, 7, 12, 292, 292, 'ये चैव सात्त्विका भावा राजसास्तामसाश्च ये।

मत्त एवेति तान्विद्धि नत्वहं तेषु ते मयि।।7.12।।', 'ye chaiva sāttvikā bhāvā rājasās tāmasāśh cha ye
matta eveti tān viddhi na tvahaṁ teṣhu te mayi', '[{"word":"ye","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"sāttvikāḥ","meaning":"in the mode of goodness"},{"word":"bhāvāḥ","meaning":"states of material existence"},{"word":"rājasāḥ","meaning":"in the mode of passion"},{"word":"tāmasāḥ","meaning":"in the mode of ignorance"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"mattaḥ","meaning":"from me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"tān","meaning":"those"},{"word":"viddhi","meaning":"know"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"teṣhu","meaning":"in them"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"mayi","meaning":"in me"}]'::jsonb, 'ye—whatever; cha—and; eva—certainly; sāttvikāḥ—in the mode of goodness; bhāvāḥ—states of material existence; rājasāḥ—in the mode of passion; tāmasāḥ—in the mode of ignorance; cha—and; ye—whatever; mattaḥ—from me; eva—certainly; iti—thus; tān—those; viddhi—know; na—not; tu—but; aham—I; teṣhu—in them; te—they; mayi—in me'),
('853bbd9d-e54a-558a-8767-4d2cc1f6d2d7'::uuid, 7, 13, 293, 293, 'त्रिभिर्गुणमयैर्भावैरेभिः सर्वमिदं जगत्।

मोहितं नाभिजानाति मामेभ्यः परमव्ययम्।।7.13।।', 'tribhir guṇa-mayair bhāvair ebhiḥ sarvam idaṁ jagat
mohitaṁ nābhijānāti māmebhyaḥ param avyayam', '[{"word":"tribhiḥ","meaning":"by three"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"mayaiḥ—consisting of the modes of material nature"},{"word":"bhāvaiḥ","meaning":"states"},{"word":"ebhiḥ","meaning":"all these"},{"word":"sarvam","meaning":"whole"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"universe"},{"word":"mohitam","meaning":"deluded"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"abhijānāti","meaning":"know"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"ebhyaḥ","meaning":"these"},{"word":"param","meaning":"the supreme"},{"word":"avyayam","meaning":"imperishable"}]'::jsonb, 'tribhiḥ—by three; guṇa-mayaiḥ—consisting of the modes of material nature; bhāvaiḥ—states; ebhiḥ—all these; sarvam—whole; idam—this; jagat—universe; mohitam—deluded; na—not; abhijānāti—know; mām—me; ebhyaḥ—these; param—the supreme; avyayam—imperishable'),
('b418621f-440b-5fdd-bde2-4698c1cde91d'::uuid, 7, 14, 294, 294, 'दैवी ह्येषा गुणमयी मम माया दुरत्यया।

मामेव ये प्रपद्यन्ते मायामेतां तरन्ति ते।।7.14।।', 'daivī hyeṣhā guṇa-mayī mama māyā duratyayā
mām eva ye prapadyante māyām etāṁ taranti te', '[{"word":"daivī","meaning":"divine"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"eṣhā","meaning":"this"},{"word":"guṇa","meaning":"mayī—consisting of the three modes of nature"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"māyā","meaning":"one of God’s energies. It that veils God’s true nature from souls who have not yet attained the eligibility for God-realization"},{"word":"duratyayā","meaning":"very difficult to overcome"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"unto me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"prapadyante","meaning":"surrender"},{"word":"māyām etām","meaning":"this Maya"},{"word":"taranti","meaning":"cross over"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"}]'::jsonb, 'daivī—divine; hi—certainly; eṣhā—this; guṇa-mayī—consisting of the three modes of nature; mama—my; māyā—one of God’s energies. It that veils God’s true nature from souls who have not yet attained the eligibility for God-realization; duratyayā—very difficult to overcome; mām—unto me; eva—certainly; ye—who; prapadyante—surrender; māyām etām—this Maya; taranti—cross over; te—they'),
('32363d86-b2bb-5b43-a5be-27d4793dca46'::uuid, 7, 15, 295, 295, 'न मां दुष्कृतिनो मूढाः प्रपद्यन्ते नराधमाः।

माययापहृतज्ञाना आसुरं भावमाश्रिताः।।7.15।।', 'na māṁ duṣhkṛitino mūḍhāḥ prapadyante narādhamāḥ
māyayāpahṛita-jñānā āsuraṁ bhāvam āśhritāḥ', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"unto me"},{"word":"duṣhkṛitinaḥ","meaning":"the evil doers"},{"word":"mūḍhāḥ","meaning":"the ignorant"},{"word":"prapadyante","meaning":"surrender"},{"word":"nara","meaning":"adhamāḥ—one who lazily follows one’s lower nature"},{"word":"māyayā","meaning":"by God’s material energy"},{"word":"apahṛita jñānāḥ","meaning":"those with deluded intellect"},{"word":"āsuram","meaning":"demoniac"},{"word":"bhāvam","meaning":"nature"},{"word":"āśhritāḥ","meaning":"surrender"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; mām—unto me; duṣhkṛitinaḥ—the evil doers; mūḍhāḥ—the ignorant; prapadyante—surrender; nara-adhamāḥ—one who lazily follows one’s lower nature; māyayā—by God’s material energy; apahṛita jñānāḥ—those with deluded intellect; āsuram—demoniac; bhāvam—nature; āśhritāḥ—surrender'),
('4562982b-eb43-5eec-9758-5654fe1ed26a'::uuid, 7, 16, 296, 296, 'चतुर्विधा भजन्ते मां जनाः सुकृतिनोऽर्जुन।

आर्तो जिज्ञासुरर्थार्थी ज्ञानी च भरतर्षभ।।7.16।।', 'chatur-vidhā bhajante māṁ janāḥ sukṛitino ’rjuna
ārto jijñāsur arthārthī jñānī cha bharatarṣhabha', '[{"word":"chatuḥ","meaning":"vidhāḥ—four kinds"},{"word":"bhajante","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"janāḥ","meaning":"people"},{"word":"su","meaning":"kṛitinaḥ—those who are pious"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"ārtaḥ","meaning":"the distressed"},{"word":"jijñāsuḥ","meaning":"the seekers of knowledge"},{"word":"artha","meaning":"arthī—the seekers of material gain"},{"word":"jñānī","meaning":"those who are situated in knowledge"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"bharata","meaning":"ṛiṣhabha—The best amongst the Bharatas, Arjun"}]'::jsonb, 'chatuḥ-vidhāḥ—four kinds; bhajante—worship; mām—me; janāḥ—people; su-kṛitinaḥ—those who are pious; arjuna—Arjun; ārtaḥ—the distressed; jijñāsuḥ—the seekers of knowledge; artha-arthī—the seekers of material gain; jñānī—those who are situated in knowledge; cha—and; bharata-ṛiṣhabha—The best amongst the Bharatas, Arjun'),
('cbdd8f03-c774-56cf-a43c-6941686fac3d'::uuid, 7, 17, 297, 297, 'तेषां ज्ञानी नित्ययुक्त एकभक्ितर्विशिष्यते।

प्रियो हि ज्ञानिनोऽत्यर्थमहं स च मम प्रियः।।7.17।।', 'teṣhāṁ jñānī nitya-yukta eka-bhaktir viśhiṣhyate
priyo hi jñānino ’tyartham ahaṁ sa cha mama priyaḥ', '[{"word":"teṣhām","meaning":"amongst these"},{"word":"jñānī","meaning":"those who are situated in knowledge"},{"word":"nitya","meaning":"yuktaḥ—ever steadfast"},{"word":"eka","meaning":"exclusively"},{"word":"bhaktiḥ","meaning":"devotion"},{"word":"viśhiṣhyate","meaning":"highest"},{"word":"priyaḥ","meaning":"very dear"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"jñāninaḥ","meaning":"to the person in knowledge"},{"word":"atyartham","meaning":"highly"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"priyaḥ","meaning":"dear"}]'::jsonb, 'teṣhām—amongst these; jñānī—those who are situated in knowledge; nitya-yuktaḥ—ever steadfast; eka—exclusively; bhaktiḥ—devotion; viśhiṣhyate—highest; priyaḥ—very dear; hi—certainly; jñāninaḥ—to the person in knowledge; atyartham—highly; aham—I; saḥ—he; cha—and; mama—to me; priyaḥ—dear'),
('a1f7ac7a-69f8-5d04-9988-2ef5c7f1c886'::uuid, 7, 18, 298, 298, 'उदाराः सर्व एवैते ज्ञानी त्वात्मैव मे मतम्।

आस्थितः स हि युक्तात्मा मामेवानुत्तमां गतिम्।।7.18।।', 'udārāḥ sarva evaite jñānī tvātmaiva me matam
āsthitaḥ sa hi yuktātmā mām evānuttamāṁ gatim', '[{"word":"udārāḥ","meaning":"noble"},{"word":"sarve","meaning":"all"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"ete","meaning":"these"},{"word":"jñānī","meaning":"those in knowledge"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"ātmā eva","meaning":"my very self"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"matam","meaning":"opinion"},{"word":"āsthitaḥ","meaning":"situated"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"yukta","meaning":"ātmā—those who are united"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"in me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"anuttamām","meaning":"the supreme"},{"word":"gatim","meaning":"goal"}]'::jsonb, 'udārāḥ—noble; sarve—all; eva—indeed; ete—these; jñānī—those in knowledge; tu—but; ātmā eva—my very self; me—my; matam—opinion; āsthitaḥ—situated; saḥ—he; hi—certainly; yukta-ātmā—those who are united; mām—in me; eva—certainly; anuttamām—the supreme; gatim—goal'),
('1da4ce04-8aad-515b-a48f-79b1d63fa868'::uuid, 7, 19, 299, 299, 'बहूनां जन्मनामन्ते ज्ञानवान्मां प्रपद्यते।

वासुदेवः सर्वमिति स महात्मा सुदुर्लभः।।7.19।।', 'bahūnāṁ janmanām ante jñānavān māṁ prapadyate
vāsudevaḥ sarvam iti sa mahātmā su-durlabhaḥ', '[{"word":"bahūnām","meaning":"many"},{"word":"janmanām","meaning":"births"},{"word":"ante","meaning":"after"},{"word":"jñāna","meaning":"vān—one who is endowed with knowledge"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"unto me"},{"word":"prapadyate","meaning":"surrenders"},{"word":"vāsudevaḥ","meaning":"Shree Krishna, the son of Vasudev"},{"word":"sarvam","meaning":"all"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"that"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"that"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"ātmā—great soul"},{"word":"su","meaning":"durlabhaḥ—very rare"}]'::jsonb, 'bahūnām—many; janmanām—births; ante—after; jñāna-vān—one who is endowed with knowledge; mām—unto me; prapadyate—surrenders; vāsudevaḥ—Shree Krishna, the son of Vasudev; sarvam—all; iti—that; saḥ—that; mahā-ātmā—great soul; su-durlabhaḥ—very rare'),
('a2f515f5-e089-5d1e-a8c0-752632982add'::uuid, 7, 20, 300, 300, 'कामैस्तैस्तैर्हृतज्ञानाः प्रपद्यन्तेऽन्यदेवताः।

तं तं नियममास्थाय प्रकृत्या नियताः स्वया।।7.20।।', 'kāmais tais tair hṛita-jñānāḥ prapadyante ’nya-devatāḥ
taṁ taṁ niyamam āsthāya prakṛityā niyatāḥ svayā', '[{"word":"kāmaiḥ","meaning":"by material desires"},{"word":"taiḥ taiḥ","meaning":"by various"},{"word":"hṛita","meaning":"jñānāḥ—whose knowledge has been carried away"},{"word":"prapadyante","meaning":"surrender"},{"word":"anya","meaning":"to other"},{"word":"devatāḥ","meaning":"celestial gods"},{"word":"tam tam","meaning":"the various"},{"word":"niyamam","meaning":"rules and regulations"},{"word":"āsthāya","meaning":"following"},{"word":"prakṛityā","meaning":"by nature"},{"word":"niyatāḥ","meaning":"controlled"},{"word":"svayā","meaning":"by their own"}]'::jsonb, 'kāmaiḥ—by material desires; taiḥ taiḥ—by various; hṛita-jñānāḥ—whose knowledge has been carried away; prapadyante—surrender; anya—to other; devatāḥ—celestial gods; tam tam—the various; niyamam—rules and regulations; āsthāya—following; prakṛityā—by nature; niyatāḥ—controlled; svayā—by their own')
ON CONFLICT (chapter_number, verse_number) DO UPDATE SET sanskrit = EXCLUDED.sanskrit, transliteration = EXCLUDED.transliteration, word_meanings = EXCLUDED.word_meanings;

INSERT INTO public.gita_verses (id, chapter_number, verse_number, verse_order, external_id, sanskrit, transliteration, word_meanings, word_meanings_raw) VALUES
('a44ddd08-c380-5af6-a5fb-1a2a516026f4'::uuid, 7, 21, 301, 301, 'यो यो यां यां तनुं भक्तः श्रद्धयार्चितुमिच्छति।

तस्य तस्याचलां श्रद्धां तामेव विदधाम्यहम्।।7.21।।', 'yo yo yāṁ yāṁ tanuṁ bhaktaḥ śhraddhayārchitum ichchhati
tasya tasyāchalāṁ śhraddhāṁ tām eva vidadhāmyaham', '[{"word":"yaḥ yaḥ","meaning":"whoever"},{"word":"yām yām","meaning":"whichever"},{"word":"tanum","meaning":"form"},{"word":"bhaktaḥ","meaning":"devotee"},{"word":"śhraddhayā","meaning":"with faith"},{"word":"architum","meaning":"to worship"},{"word":"ichchhati","meaning":"desires"},{"word":"tasya tasya","meaning":"to him"},{"word":"achalām","meaning":"steady"},{"word":"śhraddhām","meaning":"faith"},{"word":"tām","meaning":"in that"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"vidadhāmi","meaning":"bestow"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"}]'::jsonb, 'yaḥ yaḥ—whoever; yām yām—whichever; tanum—form; bhaktaḥ—devotee; śhraddhayā—with faith; architum—to worship; ichchhati—desires; tasya tasya—to him; achalām—steady; śhraddhām—faith; tām—in that; eva—certainly; vidadhāmi—bestow; aham—I'),
('7537b9a0-5472-516c-9191-818afcab5983'::uuid, 7, 22, 302, 302, 'स तया श्रद्धया युक्तस्तस्याराधनमीहते।

लभते च ततः कामान्मयैव विहितान् हि तान्।।7.22।।', 'sa tayā śhraddhayā yuktas tasyārādhanam īhate
labhate cha tataḥ kāmān mayaiva vihitān hi tān', '[{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"tayā","meaning":"with that"},{"word":"śhraddhayā","meaning":"faith"},{"word":"yuktaḥ","meaning":"endowed with"},{"word":"tasya","meaning":"of that"},{"word":"ārādhanam","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"īhate","meaning":"tries to engange in"},{"word":"labhate","meaning":"obtains"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"tataḥ","meaning":"from that"},{"word":"kāmān","meaning":"desires"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"alone"},{"word":"vihitān","meaning":"granted"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"tān","meaning":"those"}]'::jsonb, 'saḥ—he; tayā—with that; śhraddhayā—faith; yuktaḥ—endowed with; tasya—of that; ārādhanam—worship; īhate—tries to engange in; labhate—obtains; cha—and; tataḥ—from that; kāmān—desires; mayā—by me; eva—alone; vihitān—granted; hi—certainly; tān—those'),
('563bcb8f-dde1-5a35-b908-7430724dbce4'::uuid, 7, 23, 303, 303, 'अन्तवत्तु फलं तेषां तद्भवत्यल्पमेधसाम्।

देवान्देवयजो यान्ति मद्भक्ता यान्ति मामपि।।7.23।।', 'antavat tu phalaṁ teṣhāṁ tad bhavatyalpa-medhasām
devān deva-yajo yānti mad-bhaktā yānti mām api', '[{"word":"anta","meaning":"vat—perishable"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"phalam","meaning":"fruit"},{"word":"teṣhām","meaning":"by them"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"bhavati","meaning":"is"},{"word":"alpa","meaning":"medhasām—people of small understanding"},{"word":"devān","meaning":"to the celestial gods"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"yajaḥ—the worshipers of the celestial gods"},{"word":"yānti","meaning":"go"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"my"},{"word":"bhaktāḥ","meaning":"devotees"},{"word":"yānti","meaning":"go"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"api","meaning":"whereas"}]'::jsonb, 'anta-vat—perishable; tu—but; phalam—fruit; teṣhām—by them; tat—that; bhavati—is; alpa-medhasām—people of small understanding; devān—to the celestial gods; deva-yajaḥ—the worshipers of the celestial gods; yānti—go; mat—my; bhaktāḥ—devotees; yānti—go; mām—to me; api—whereas'),
('322e38cb-afc4-5c75-8d95-23bbe3ebdc49'::uuid, 7, 24, 304, 304, 'अव्यक्तं व्यक्ितमापन्नं मन्यन्ते मामबुद्धयः।

परं भावमजानन्तो ममाव्ययमनुत्तमम्।।7.24।।', 'avyaktaṁ vyaktim āpannaṁ manyante mām abuddhayaḥ
