('7740a559-0254-5e03-b5b0-0e24bb5099e1'::uuid, 8, 10, 320, 320, 'प्रयाणकाले मनसाऽचलेन

भक्त्या युक्तो योगबलेन चैव।

भ्रुवोर्मध्ये प्राणमावेश्य सम्यक्

स तं परं पुरुषमुपैति दिव्यम्।।8.10।।', 'prayāṇa-kāle manasāchalena
bhaktyā yukto yoga-balena chaiva
bhruvor madhye prāṇam āveśhya samyak
sa taṁ paraṁ puruṣham upaiti divyam', '[{"word":"prayāṇa","meaning":"kāle—at the time of death"},{"word":"manasā","meaning":"mind"},{"word":"achalena","meaning":"steadily"},{"word":"bhaktyā","meaning":"remembering with great devotion"},{"word":"yuktaḥ","meaning":"united"},{"word":"yoga","meaning":"balena—through the power of yog"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"bhruvoḥ","meaning":"the two eyebrows"},{"word":"madhye","meaning":"between"},{"word":"prāṇam","meaning":"life airs"},{"word":"āveśhya","meaning":"fixing"},{"word":"samyak","meaning":"completely"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"tam","meaning":"him"},{"word":"param puruṣham","meaning":"the Supreme Divine Lord"},{"word":"upaiti","meaning":"attains"},{"word":"divyam","meaning":"divine"}]'::jsonb, 'prayāṇa-kāle—at the time of death; manasā—mind; achalena—steadily; bhaktyā—remembering with great devotion; yuktaḥ—united; yoga-balena—through the power of yog; cha—and; eva—certainly; bhruvoḥ—the two eyebrows; madhye—between; prāṇam—life airs; āveśhya—fixing; samyak—completely; saḥ—he; tam—him; param puruṣham—the Supreme Divine Lord; upaiti—attains; divyam—divine'),
('229f7af3-6bfa-5243-9fac-87d086cd898c'::uuid, 8, 11, 321, 321, 'यदक्षरं वेदविदो वदन्ति

विशन्ति यद्यतयो वीतरागाः।

यदिच्छन्तो ब्रह्मचर्यं चरन्ति

तत्ते पदं संग्रहेण प्रवक्ष्ये।।8.11।।', 'yad akṣharaṁ veda-vido vadanti
viśhanti yad yatayo vīta-rāgāḥ
yad ichchhanto brahmacharyaṁ charanti
tat te padaṁ saṅgraheṇa pravakṣhye', '[{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"akṣharam","meaning":"Imperishable"},{"word":"veda","meaning":"vidaḥ—scholars of the Vedas"},{"word":"vadanti","meaning":"describe"},{"word":"viśhanti","meaning":"enter"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"yatayaḥ","meaning":"great ascetics"},{"word":"vīta","meaning":"rāgāḥ—free from attachment"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"ichchhantaḥ","meaning":"desiring"},{"word":"brahmacharyam","meaning":"celibacy"},{"word":"charanti","meaning":"practice"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"padam","meaning":"goal"},{"word":"saṅgraheṇa","meaning":"briefly"},{"word":"pravakṣhye","meaning":"I shall explain"}]'::jsonb, 'yat—which; akṣharam—Imperishable; veda-vidaḥ—scholars of the Vedas; vadanti—describe; viśhanti—enter; yat—which; yatayaḥ—great ascetics; vīta-rāgāḥ—free from attachment; yat—which; ichchhantaḥ—desiring; brahmacharyam—celibacy; charanti—practice; tat—that; te—to you; padam—goal; saṅgraheṇa—briefly; pravakṣhye—I shall explain'),
('f2222c2c-776e-51cf-840f-47309970f4d2'::uuid, 8, 12, 322, 322, 'सर्वद्वाराणि संयम्य मनो हृदि निरुध्य च।

मूर्ध्न्याधायात्मनः प्राणमास्थितो योगधारणाम्।।8.12।।', 'sarva-dvārāṇi sanyamya mano hṛidi nirudhya cha
