('2c463b87-9b9e-517f-8805-2a457aebb10c'::uuid, 8, 13, 323, 323, 'ओमित्येकाक्षरं ब्रह्म व्याहरन्मामनुस्मरन्।

यः प्रयाति त्यजन्देहं स याति परमां गतिम्।।8.13।।', 'oṁ ityekākṣharaṁ brahma vyāharan mām anusmaran
yaḥ prayāti tyajan dehaṁ sa yāti paramāṁ gatim', '[{"word":"om","meaning":"sacred syllable representing the formless aspect of God"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"eka","meaning":"akṣharam—one syllabled"},{"word":"brahma","meaning":"the Absolute Truth"},{"word":"vyāharan","meaning":"chanting"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me (Shree Krishna)"},{"word":"anusmaran","meaning":"remembering"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"prayāti","meaning":"departs"},{"word":"tyajan","meaning":"quitting"},{"word":"deham","meaning":"the body"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"yāti","meaning":"attains"},{"word":"paramām","meaning":"the supreme"},{"word":"gatim","meaning":"goal"}]'::jsonb, 'om—sacred syllable representing the formless aspect of God; iti—thus; eka-akṣharam—one syllabled; brahma—the Absolute Truth; vyāharan—chanting; mām—me (Shree Krishna); anusmaran—remembering; yaḥ—who; prayāti—departs; tyajan—quitting; deham—the body; saḥ—he; yāti—attains; paramām—the supreme; gatim—goal'),
('36a57b78-8af1-5f62-ac68-67c2b3e81294'::uuid, 8, 14, 324, 324, 'अनन्यचेताः सततं यो मां स्मरति नित्यशः।

तस्याहं सुलभः पार्थ नित्ययुक्तस्य योगिनः।।8.14।।', 'ananya-chetāḥ satataṁ yo māṁ smarati nityaśhaḥ
