('e59761d3-66f8-540d-89bb-4ecb7fd44773'::uuid, 8, 17, 327, 327, 'सहस्रयुगपर्यन्तमहर्यद्ब्रह्मणो विदुः।

रात्रिं युगसहस्रान्तां तेऽहोरात्रविदो जनाः।।8.17।।', 'sahasra-yuga-paryantam ahar yad brahmaṇo viduḥ
rātriṁ yuga-sahasrāntāṁ te ’ho-rātra-vido janāḥ', '[{"word":"sahasra","meaning":"one thousand"},{"word":"yuga","meaning":"age"},{"word":"paryantam","meaning":"until"},{"word":"ahaḥ","meaning":"one day"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"brahmaṇaḥ","meaning":"of Brahma"},{"word":"viduḥ","meaning":"know"},{"word":"rātrim","meaning":"night"},{"word":"yuga","meaning":"sahasra-antām—lasts one thousand yugas"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"ahaḥ","meaning":"rātra-vidaḥ—those who know his day and night"},{"word":"janāḥ","meaning":"people"}]'::jsonb, 'sahasra—one thousand; yuga—age; paryantam—until; ahaḥ—one day; yat—which; brahmaṇaḥ—of Brahma; viduḥ—know; rātrim—night; yuga-sahasra-antām—lasts one thousand yugas; te—they; ahaḥ-rātra-vidaḥ—those who know his day and night; janāḥ—people'),
('8b2e2dff-85ef-5fb8-a057-118fd1e19f0c'::uuid, 8, 18, 328, 328, 'अव्यक्ताद्व्यक्तयः सर्वाः प्रभवन्त्यहरागमे।

रात्र्यागमे प्रलीयन्ते तत्रैवाव्यक्तसंज्ञके।।8.18।।', 'avyaktād vyaktayaḥ sarvāḥ prabhavantyahar-āgame
rātryāgame pralīyante tatraivāvyakta-sanjñake', '[{"word":"avyaktāt","meaning":"from the unmanifested"},{"word":"vyaktayaḥ","meaning":"the manifested"},{"word":"sarvāḥ","meaning":"all"},{"word":"prabhavanti","meaning":"emanate"},{"word":"ahaḥ","meaning":"āgame—at the advent of Brahma’s day"},{"word":"rātri","meaning":"āgame—at the fall of Brahma’s night"},{"word":"pralīyante","meaning":"they dissolve"},{"word":"tatra","meaning":"into that"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"avyakta","meaning":"sanjñake—in that which is called the unmanifest"}]'::jsonb, 'avyaktāt—from the unmanifested; vyaktayaḥ—the manifested; sarvāḥ—all; prabhavanti—emanate; ahaḥ-āgame—at the advent of Brahma’s day; rātri-āgame—at the fall of Brahma’s night; pralīyante—they dissolve; tatra—into that; eva—certainly; avyakta-sanjñake—in that which is called the unmanifest'),
('d82bcfff-8d2c-53b9-8e56-cacfd5830a74'::uuid, 8, 19, 329, 329, 'भूतग्रामः स एवायं भूत्वा भूत्वा प्रलीयते।

रात्र्यागमेऽवशः पार्थ प्रभवत्यहरागमे।।8.19।।', 'bhūta-grāmaḥ sa evāyaṁ bhūtvā bhūtvā pralīyate
rātryāgame ’vaśhaḥ pārtha prabhavatyahar-āgame', '[{"word":"bhūta","meaning":"grāmaḥ—the multitude of beings"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"these"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"ayam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"bhūtvā bhūtvā","meaning":"repeatedly taking birth"},{"word":"pralīyate","meaning":"dissolves"},{"word":"rātri","meaning":"āgame—with the advent of night"},{"word":"avaśhaḥ","meaning":"helpless"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"prabhavati","meaning":"become manifest"},{"word":"ahaḥ","meaning":"āgame—with the advent of day"}]'::jsonb, 'bhūta-grāmaḥ—the multitude of beings; saḥ—these; eva—certainly; ayam—this; bhūtvā bhūtvā—repeatedly taking birth; pralīyate—dissolves; rātri-āgame—with the advent of night; avaśhaḥ—helpless; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; prabhavati—become manifest; ahaḥ-āgame—with the advent of day'),
('a5f52f99-5d8e-540f-99e9-727da5167afc'::uuid, 8, 20, 330, 330, 'परस्तस्मात्तु भावोऽन्योऽव्यक्तोऽव्यक्तात्सनातनः।

यः स सर्वेषु भूतेषु नश्यत्सु न विनश्यति।।8.20।।', 'paras tasmāt tu bhāvo ’nyo ’vyakto ’vyaktāt sanātanaḥ
