('a15d2915-ab75-5147-b69e-83ffb90778de'::uuid, 8, 23, 333, 333, 'यत्र काले त्वनावृत्तिमावृत्तिं चैव योगिनः।

प्रयाता यान्ति तं कालं वक्ष्यामि भरतर्षभ।।8.23।।', 'yatra kāle tvanāvṛittim āvṛittiṁ chaiva yoginaḥ
prayātā yānti taṁ kālaṁ vakṣhyāmi bharatarṣhabha', '[{"word":"yatra","meaning":"where"},{"word":"kāle","meaning":"time"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"anāvṛittim","meaning":"no return"},{"word":"āvṛittim","meaning":"return"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"yoginaḥ","meaning":"a yogi"},{"word":"prayātāḥ","meaning":"having departed"},{"word":"yānti","meaning":"attain"},{"word":"tam","meaning":"that"},{"word":"kālam","meaning":"time"},{"word":"vakṣhyāmi","meaning":"I shall describe"},{"word":"bharata","meaning":"ṛiṣhabha—Arjun, the best of the Bharatas"}]'::jsonb, 'yatra—where; kāle—time; tu—certainly; anāvṛittim—no return; āvṛittim—return; cha—and; eva—certainly; yoginaḥ—a yogi; prayātāḥ—having departed; yānti—attain; tam—that; kālam—time; vakṣhyāmi—I shall describe; bharata-ṛiṣhabha—Arjun, the best of the Bharatas;'),
('46e0ee3c-ed51-5493-9e72-24f889d6ad5e'::uuid, 8, 24, 334, 334, 'अग्निर्ज्योतिरहः शुक्लः षण्मासा उत्तरायणम्।

तत्र प्रयाता गच्छन्ति ब्रह्म ब्रह्मविदो जनाः।।8.24।।', 'agnir jyotir ahaḥ śhuklaḥ ṣhaṇ-māsā uttarāyaṇam
