('64ecf1da-d332-5de6-9cc6-29542ebcdbd3'::uuid, 8, 27, 337, 337, 'नैते सृती पार्थ जानन्योगी मुह्यति कश्चन।

तस्मात्सर्वेषु कालेषु योगयुक्तो भवार्जुन।।8.27।।', 'naite sṛitī pārtha jānan yogī muhyati kaśhchana
tasmāt sarveṣhu kāleṣhu yoga-yukto bhavārjuna', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"ete","meaning":"these two"},{"word":"sṛitī","meaning":"paths"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"jānan","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"yogī","meaning":"a yogi"},{"word":"muhyati","meaning":"bewildered"},{"word":"kaśhchana","meaning":"any"},{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"sarveṣhu kāleṣhu","meaning":"always"},{"word":"yoga","meaning":"yuktaḥ—situated in Yog"},{"word":"bhava","meaning":"be"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"}]'::jsonb, 'na—never; ete—these two; sṛitī—paths; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; jānan—knowing; yogī—a yogi; muhyati—bewildered; kaśhchana—any; tasmāt—therefore; sarveṣhu kāleṣhu—always; yoga-yuktaḥ—situated in Yog; bhava—be; arjuna—Arjun'),
('6ed58d47-8424-5726-a484-f983fe7f90e4'::uuid, 8, 28, 338, 338, 'वेदेषु यज्ञेषु तपःसु चैव

दानेषु यत्पुण्यफलं प्रदिष्टम्।

अत्येति तत्सर्वमिदं विदित्वा

योगी परं स्थानमुपैति चाद्यम्।।8.28।।', 'vedeṣhu yajñeṣhu tapaḥsu chaiva
dāneṣhu yat puṇya-phalaṁ pradiṣhṭam
atyeti tat sarvam idaṁ viditvā
yogī paraṁ sthānam upaiti chādyam', '[{"word":"vedeṣhu","meaning":"in the study of the Vedas"},{"word":"yajñeṣhu","meaning":"in performance of sacrifices"},{"word":"tapaḥsu","meaning":"in austerities"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"dāneṣhu","meaning":"in giving charities"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"puṇya","meaning":"phalam—fruit of merit"},{"word":"pradiṣhṭam","meaning":"is gained"},{"word":"atyeti","meaning":"surpasses"},{"word":"tat sarvam","meaning":"all"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"viditvā","meaning":"having known"},{"word":"yogī","meaning":"a yogi"},{"word":"param","meaning":"Supreme"},{"word":"sthānam","meaning":"Abode"},{"word":"upaiti","meaning":"achieves"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"ādyam","meaning":"original"}]'::jsonb, 'vedeṣhu—in the study of the Vedas; yajñeṣhu—in performance of sacrifices; tapaḥsu—in austerities; cha—and; eva—certainly; dāneṣhu—in giving charities; yat—which; puṇya-phalam—fruit of merit; pradiṣhṭam—is gained; atyeti—surpasses; tat sarvam—all; idam—this; viditvā—having known; yogī—a yogi; param—Supreme; sthānam—Abode; upaiti—achieves; cha—and; ādyam—original'),
('5cb6ec4b-1ec9-534d-9dfd-ab24b0b469ec'::uuid, 9, 1, 339, 339, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

इदं तु ते गुह्यतमं प्रवक्ष्याम्यनसूयवे।

ज्ञानं विज्ञानसहितं यज्ज्ञात्वा मोक्ष्यसेऽशुभात्।।9.1।।', 'śhrī bhagavān uvācha
idaṁ tu te guhyatamaṁ pravakṣhyāmyanasūyave
jñānaṁ vijñāna-sahitaṁ yaj jñātvā mokṣhyase ’śhubhāt', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"guhya","meaning":"tamam—the most confidential"},{"word":"pravakṣhyāmi","meaning":"I shall impart"},{"word":"anasūyave","meaning":"nonenvious"},{"word":"jñānam","meaning":"knowledge"},{"word":"vijñāna","meaning":"realized knowledge"},{"word":"sahitam","meaning":"with"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"mokṣhyase","meaning":"you will be released"},{"word":"aśhubhāt","meaning":"miseries of material existence"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said; idam—this; tu—but; te—to you; guhya-tamam—the most confidential; pravakṣhyāmi—I shall impart; anasūyave—nonenvious; jñānam—knowledge; vijñāna—realized knowledge; sahitam—with; yat—which; jñātvā—knowing; mokṣhyase—you will be released; aśhubhāt—miseries of material existence'),
('2a712fc2-43bf-57b0-9256-6951f09756f7'::uuid, 9, 2, 340, 340, 'राजविद्या राजगुह्यं पवित्रमिदमुत्तमम्।

प्रत्यक्षावगमं धर्म्यं सुसुखं कर्तुमव्ययम्।।9.2।।', 'rāja-vidyā rāja-guhyaṁ pavitram idam uttamam
