('09a9275c-8aed-53ec-8d58-3dfb46927cc6'::uuid, 9, 4, 342, 342, 'मया ततमिदं सर्वं जगदव्यक्तमूर्तिना।

मत्स्थानि सर्वभूतानि न चाहं तेष्ववस्थितः।।9.4।।', 'mayā tatam idaṁ sarvaṁ jagad avyakta-mūrtinā
mat-sthāni sarva-bhūtāni na chāhaṁ teṣhvavasthitaḥ', '[{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"tatam","meaning":"pervaded"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"sarvam","meaning":"entire"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"cosmic manifestation"},{"word":"avyakta","meaning":"mūrtinā—the unmanifested form"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"sthāni—in me"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūtāni—all living beings"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"teṣhu","meaning":"in them"},{"word":"avasthitaḥ","meaning":"dwell"}]'::jsonb, 'mayā—by me; tatam—pervaded; idam—this; sarvam—entire; jagat—cosmic manifestation; avyakta-mūrtinā—the unmanifested form; mat-sthāni—in me; sarva-bhūtāni—all living beings; na—not; cha—and; aham—I; teṣhu—in them; avasthitaḥ—dwell'),
('506a222e-9e68-55cb-aee2-53e4a265d737'::uuid, 9, 5, 343, 343, 'न च मत्स्थानि भूतानि पश्य मे योगमैश्वरम्।

भूतभृन्न च भूतस्थो ममात्मा भूतभावनः।।9.5।।', 'na cha mat-sthāni bhūtāni paśhya me yogam aiśhwaram
bhūta-bhṛin na cha bhūta-stho mamātmā bhūta-bhāvanaḥ', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"sthāni—abide in me"},{"word":"bhūtāni","meaning":"all living beings"},{"word":"paśhya","meaning":"behold"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"yogam aiśhwaram","meaning":"divine energy"},{"word":"bhūta","meaning":"bhṛit—the sustainer of all living beings"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"yet"},{"word":"bhūta","meaning":"sthaḥ—dwelling in"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"my"},{"word":"ātmā","meaning":"self"},{"word":"bhūta","meaning":"bhāvanaḥ—the creator of all beings"}]'::jsonb, 'na—never; cha—and; mat-sthāni—abide in me; bhūtāni—all living beings; paśhya—behold; me—my; yogam aiśhwaram—divine energy; bhūta-bhṛit—the sustainer of all living beings; na—never; cha—yet; bhūta-sthaḥ—dwelling in; mama—my; ātmā—self; bhūta-bhāvanaḥ—the creator of all beings'),
('b4c94307-c261-526e-8e49-c014d748788a'::uuid, 9, 6, 344, 344, 'यथाऽऽकाशस्थितो नित्यं वायुः सर्वत्रगो महान्।

तथा सर्वाणि भूतानि मत्स्थानीत्युपधारय।।9.6।।', 'yathākāśha-sthito nityaṁ vāyuḥ sarvatra-go mahān
tathā sarvāṇi bhūtāni mat-sthānītyupadhāraya', '[{"word":"yathā","meaning":"as"},{"word":"ākāśha","meaning":"sthitaḥ—rests in the sky"},{"word":"nityam","meaning":"always"},{"word":"vāyuḥ","meaning":"the wind"},{"word":"sarvatra","meaning":"gaḥ—blowing everywhere"},{"word":"mahān","meaning":"mighty"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"likewise"},{"word":"sarvāṇi bhūtāni","meaning":"all living beings"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"sthāni—rest in me"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"upadhāraya","meaning":"know"}]'::jsonb, 'yathā—as; ākāśha-sthitaḥ—rests in the sky; nityam—always; vāyuḥ—the wind; sarvatra-gaḥ—blowing everywhere; mahān—mighty; tathā—likewise; sarvāṇi bhūtāni—all living beings; mat-sthāni—rest in me; iti—thus; upadhāraya—know'),
('b1bfddf1-d293-5863-83b3-520157d7d7ba'::uuid, 9, 7, 345, 345, 'सर्वभूतानि कौन्तेय प्रकृतिं यान्ति मामिकाम्।

कल्पक्षये पुनस्तानि कल्पादौ विसृजाम्यहम्।।9.7।।', 'sarva-bhūtāni kaunteya prakṛitiṁ yānti māmikām
