('47b344ec-b43e-5fde-85d8-7dee4b90fe88'::uuid, 9, 13, 351, 351, 'महात्मानस्तु मां पार्थ दैवीं प्रकृतिमाश्रिताः।

भजन्त्यनन्यमनसो ज्ञात्वा भूतादिमव्ययम्।।9.13।।', 'mahātmānas tu māṁ pārtha daivīṁ prakṛitim āśhritāḥ
bhajantyananya-manaso jñātvā bhūtādim avyayam', '[{"word":"mahā","meaning":"ātmānaḥ—the great souls"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"pārtha","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pritha"},{"word":"daivīm prakṛitim","meaning":"divine energy"},{"word":"āśhritāḥ","meaning":"take shelter of"},{"word":"bhajanti","meaning":"engage in devotion"},{"word":"ananya","meaning":"manasaḥ—with mind fixed exclusively"},{"word":"jñātvā","meaning":"knowing"},{"word":"bhūta","meaning":"all creation"},{"word":"ādim","meaning":"the origin"},{"word":"avyayam","meaning":"imperishable"}]'::jsonb, 'mahā-ātmānaḥ—the great souls; tu—but; mām—me; pārtha—Arjun, the son of Pritha; daivīm prakṛitim—divine energy; āśhritāḥ—take shelter of; bhajanti—engage in devotion; ananya-manasaḥ—with mind fixed exclusively; jñātvā—knowing; bhūta—all creation; ādim—the origin; avyayam—imperishable'),
('db488ea7-8b3f-5c9a-ad38-9b161f25d24a'::uuid, 9, 14, 352, 352, 'सततं कीर्तयन्तो मां यतन्तश्च दृढव्रताः।

नमस्यन्तश्च मां भक्त्या नित्ययुक्ता उपासते।।9.14।।', 'satataṁ kīrtayanto māṁ yatantaśh cha dṛiḍha-vratāḥ
